(4323910, 622790, 7467, '<td valign="top">like the lighting.... nice</td>', 'like the lighting.... nice', '2007-12-19 16:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323911, 621855, 7467, '<td valign="top">sideways???</td>', 'sideways???', '2007-12-19 16:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323915, 622433, 7467, '<td valign="top">Love those cardinals.. nice sharp pic</td>', 'Love those cardinals.. nice sharp pic', '2007-12-19 16:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323919, 622323, 7467, '<td valign="top">snapshot does not work for me...sorry</td>', 'snapshot does not work for me...sorry', '2007-12-19 16:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323921, 623587, 7467, '<td valign="top">not much is in focus... boats are distracting</td>', 'not much is in focus... boats are distracting', '2007-12-19 16:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323925, 623234, 7467, '<td valign="top">missing something....</td>', 'missing something....', '2007-12-19 16:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323927, 623016, 83940, '<td valign="top">Nice shot love the idea of the shadow.</td>', 'Nice shot love the idea of the shadow.', '2007-12-19 16:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323974, 623771, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours, textures and shapes. I think composition could be stronger by removing a vertical strip from the left hand side.</td>', 'Lovely colours, textures and shapes. I think composition could be stronger by removing a vertical strip from the left hand side.', '2007-12-19 16:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323976, 622793, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like how the shapes of the bubbles echo the curved dome of the yolk.</td>', 'I like how the shapes of the bubbles echo the curved dome of the yolk.', '2007-12-19 16:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323980, 623511, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple items, simply made. I like the low-key lighting here that emphasises the focus on form.</td>', 'Simple items, simply made. I like the low-key lighting here that emphasises the focus on form.', '2007-12-19 16:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323982, 623496, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great high contrast image with lots of interesting details in the surfaces, the lins, the silhouettes and so on. Intriguing.</td>', 'Great high contrast image with lots of interesting details in the surfaces, the lins, the silhouettes and so on. Intriguing.', '2007-12-19 16:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323983, 623496, 65319, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop staring at this photo as my eye wanders around to all the detail.  The silhouettes and reflections are just astounding especially the reflection in the piano body.  A beautiful work of art. <br/> <br/>Edit:  I had to come back and mark this a fav...I just love it!</td>', 'I can''t stop staring at this photo as my eye wanders around to all the detail.  The silhouettes and reflections are just astounding especially the reflection in the piano body.  A beautiful work of art.  Edit:  I had to come back and mark this a fav...I just love it!', '2007-12-19 16:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323986, 622938, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely and simple winter detail. I like the way that a single leaf remains, brittle, weathered, hanging on when all others have fallen. The shallow DOF creates a lovely effect of the branches and background behind.</td>', 'Lovely and simple winter detail. I like the way that a single leaf remains, brittle, weathered, hanging on when all others have fallen. The shallow DOF creates a lovely effect of the branches and background behind.', '2007-12-19 16:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323988, 623357, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF and the lighting certainly emphasises texture and shapes.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF and the lighting certainly emphasises texture and shapes.', '2007-12-19 16:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323991, 622776, 12317, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! Ducks kill me! At first glance I thought it is a simple upside down picture, then I noticed the ducks and got totally confused. I couldn''t help rotating the picture to prove myself that yes, it is an upside down (but not simple!) Congrats!</td>', 'Wow!!! Ducks kill me! At first glance I thought it is a simple upside down picture, then I noticed the ducks and got totally confused. I couldn''t help rotating the picture to prove myself that yes, it is an upside down (but not simple!) Congrats!', '2007-12-19 16:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323992, 623874, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns of the rust and the repetitive lines work well but overall I think the image lacks a focal point that and hence the composition feels a little lacking.</td>', 'I like the patterns of the rust and the repetitive lines work well but overall I think the image lacks a focal point that and hence the composition feels a little lacking.', '2007-12-19 16:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323994, 623016, 85248, '<td valign="top">I like the symbolism, but might have just made this a nice mono shot.  Great job!</td>', 'I like the symbolism, but might have just made this a nice mono shot.  Great job!', '2007-12-19 17:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4323999, 622649, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image of something very everyday. The texture and shapes/lines of the worn bricks is appealing as is the warm light and your interesting viewpoint/ composition.</td>', 'A beautiful image of something very everyday. The texture and shapes/lines of the worn bricks is appealing as is the warm light and your interesting viewpoint/ composition.', '2007-12-19 17:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324002, 622691, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have taken care to really capture the texture of this lovely old sugar pot. The criss-crossing lines covering the surface, and the way they catch and throw the light, are attractive. The shallow DOF throwing out the background into a smooth, pleasing green is also nice. I''m not sure that composition is very strong but certainly better than a straight on/ centred shot.</td>', 'I like the way you have taken care to really capture the texture of this lovely old sugar pot. The criss-crossing lines covering the surface, and the way they catch and throw the light, are attractive. The shallow DOF throwing out the background into a smooth, pleasing green is also nice. I''m not sure that composition is very strong but certainly better than a straight on/ centred shot.', '2007-12-19 17:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324003, 623705, 85248, '<td valign="top">A little too "centered" for my taste...</td>', 'A little too "centered" for my taste...', '2007-12-19 17:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324009, 623355, 3087, '<td valign="top">Some lovely texture in the weathered metal and wood. Composition doesn''t really work for me and the intruding ivy doesn''t contribute for me. I think a tighter study of the bolt and weathered wood might be stronger.</td>', 'Some lovely texture in the weathered metal and wood. Composition doesn''t really work for me and the intruding ivy doesn''t contribute for me. I think a tighter study of the bolt and weathered wood might be stronger.', '2007-12-19 17:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324015, 622754, 3087, '<td valign="top">Really interesting contrast of colours AND textures. And the shallow DOF works very well to emphasise that contrast by making the green plants even more organic by smoothing their shapes compared to the hard straight edges of the man-made wooden item. In that wooden item itself I love the fact that we can see the texture of the woodworking and the imperfections in the finish that let us know it is a hand-made piece. The composition, with the overhanging ledge, is unusual but it works.</td>', 'Really interesting contrast of colours AND textures. And the shallow DOF works very well to emphasise that contrast by making the green plants even more organic by smoothing their shapes compared to the hard straight edges of the man-made wooden item. In that wooden item itself I love the fact that we can see the texture of the woodworking and the imperfections in the finish that let us know it is a hand-made piece. The composition, with the overhanging ledge, is unusual but it works.', '2007-12-19 17:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324024, 623227, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful architecure. Interesting perspective. Lovely textures and patterns of natural wood against modern glass and metal.</td>', 'Beautiful architecure. Interesting perspective. Lovely textures and patterns of natural wood against modern glass and metal.', '2007-12-19 17:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324029, 623862, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nice perspective and great timing to capture the light just so - I like the flare as well as the lovely light and shadows on the strong architectural forms.</td>', 'A nice perspective and great timing to capture the light just so - I like the flare as well as the lovely light and shadows on the strong architectural forms.', '2007-12-19 17:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324034, 623493, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely rusted car, the shape and textures and colours are a delight. The composition doesn''t quite work for me because of the way the black bumper knobby thing (don''t know what it''s called) on the lower left is touching/slightly cropped by the edge of the frame but it''s a minor thing.</td>', 'Lovely rusted car, the shape and textures and colours are a delight. The composition doesn''t quite work for me because of the way the black bumper knobby thing (don''t know what it''s called) on the lower left is touching/slightly cropped by the edge of the frame but it''s a minor thing.', '2007-12-19 17:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324036, 623283, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of wonderfully weather worn building. I like the colours, textures and shapes, especially as they contrast between the natural plants and snow.</td>', 'Nice capture of wonderfully weather worn building. I like the colours, textures and shapes, especially as they contrast between the natural plants and snow.', '2007-12-19 17:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324039, 622610, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple yet beautiful. This is all about form and light. The unusual composition with the two silver circles to the left, the tops of the panels at hte bottom and the blind taking up most of the frame, works well for me. But most of all I love the striped light spilling through and to the side. Lovely.</td>', 'Simple yet beautiful. This is all about form and light. The unusual composition with the two silver circles to the left, the tops of the panels at hte bottom and the blind taking up most of the frame, works well for me. But most of all I love the striped light spilling through and to the side. Lovely.', '2007-12-19 17:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324041, 623787, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely textures and colours, nice light, lovely bokeh in background. But focus, for me, should be on centre of the rings in the tree trunk and not to the right hand edge of the surface as you have it.</td>', 'Lovely textures and colours, nice light, lovely bokeh in background. But focus, for me, should be on centre of the rings in the tree trunk and not to the right hand edge of the surface as you have it.', '2007-12-19 17:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324043, 623653, 3087, '<td valign="top">High contrast black and white really brings out the strong lines and shapes and the diverse and interesting textures.</td>', 'High contrast black and white really brings out the strong lines and shapes and the diverse and interesting textures.', '2007-12-19 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324047, 623860, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like that sickly green against the cold grey and dark browns. Composition is strengthened by the diagonal of the pipe and placement of leaf works well in that. Texture and shape of leaf is just beautiful.</td>', 'I like that sickly green against the cold grey and dark browns. Composition is strengthened by the diagonal of the pipe and placement of leaf works well in that. Texture and shape of leaf is just beautiful.', '2007-12-19 17:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324050, 622763, 3087, '<td valign="top">A much loved piece of pottery, loved perhaps more for it''s imperfections and assymmetry than for it''s utility. I have a similar piece of my own!</td>', 'A much loved piece of pottery, loved perhaps more for it''s imperfections and assymmetry than for it''s utility. I have a similar piece of my own!', '2007-12-19 17:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324051, 623641, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and DOF/bokeh. Lovely contrast between rich browns and white water droplets.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and DOF/bokeh. Lovely contrast between rich browns and white water droplets.', '2007-12-19 17:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324052, 623880, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting works very well.</td>', 'Lighting works very well.', '2007-12-19 17:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324055, 622612, 3087, '<td valign="top">Grows on me as I look at it longer, though the blown out leaves in the centre bother me. The outer areas of the image, with the high contrast but still some texture and detail in the leaves, are stronger, for me.</td>', 'Grows on me as I look at it longer, though the blown out leaves in the centre bother me. The outer areas of the image, with the high contrast but still some texture and detail in the leaves, are stronger, for me.', '2007-12-19 17:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324061, 623671, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting "still life" with lovely choice of complementing colours and textures. I don''t like the crop to the left hand side - it''s a touch too close to the edge of the bowl. But overall, like this very much indeed.</td>', 'An interesting "still life" with lovely choice of complementing colours and textures. I don''t like the crop to the left hand side - it''s a touch too close to the edge of the bowl. But overall, like this very much indeed.', '2007-12-19 17:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324065, 622625, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sew! A needle pulling threeaaaad! ;) Sweet idea! Lighting feels a bit flat.</td>', 'Sew! A needle pulling threeaaaad! ;) Sweet idea! Lighting feels a bit flat.', '2007-12-19 17:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324067, 623742, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen many images combining road surface and puddle reflection, this is one of the more successful in the way that the two yellow lines create such an effective composition with the tree branches and sky.</td>', 'I''ve seen many images combining road surface and puddle reflection, this is one of the more successful in the way that the two yellow lines create such an effective composition with the tree branches and sky.', '2007-12-19 17:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324069, 621897, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and details. Like the blue-toned presentation.</td>', 'Nice shapes and details. Like the blue-toned presentation.', '2007-12-19 17:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324074, 623806, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and textures, composition works too, nice contrast and tonal range. Is this a lens baby image? That off-kilter feeling of in-focus and out-of-focus areas reminds me of lens-baby or Holga images. In any case, I like it.</td>', 'Beautiful colours and textures, composition works too, nice contrast and tonal range. Is this a lens baby image? That off-kilter feeling of in-focus and out-of-focus areas reminds me of lens-baby or Holga images. In any case, I like it.', '2007-12-19 17:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324078, 623340, 75192, '<td valign="top">Just absolutely PERFECT. 10/10</td>', 'Just absolutely PERFECT. 10/10', '2007-12-19 17:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324080, 623241, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unlike many entries, you seem to have read the description and taken onboard the wabi-sabi thing. I like that your subject is an everyday functional item - the beauty we see in the textures and colours that have come from weathering were not planned for when the object was designed/ created. Composition good too.</td>', 'Unlike many entries, you seem to have read the description and taken onboard the wabi-sabi thing. I like that your subject is an everyday functional item - the beauty we see in the textures and colours that have come from weathering were not planned for when the object was designed/ created. Composition good too.', '2007-12-19 17:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324081, 622705, 75192, '<td valign="top">mMMmm interesting concept.</td>', 'mMMmm interesting concept.', '2007-12-19 17:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324084, 622918, 75192, '<td valign="top">I love innovative and creative shots like this.... because the boring same old, same old in these free studies can become tiresome to view.<br/> <br/>Great shot, great idea - 9/10</td>', 'I love innovative and creative shots like this.... because the boring same old, same old in these free studies can become tiresome to view. Great shot, great idea - 9/10', '2007-12-19 17:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324085, 623337, 3087, '<td valign="top">What lovely wearing and staining and textures and shapes and lines in such functional and "ugly" objects. Truly fits into the wabi-sabi of the description, which many seem to have ignored.</td>', 'What lovely wearing and staining and textures and shapes and lines in such functional and "ugly" objects. Truly fits into the wabi-sabi of the description, which many seem to have ignored.', '2007-12-19 17:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324087, 623516, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures and colours in the worn surface and I like it against the other texture of the wall/ground. The shadow is good too.</td>', 'Wonderful textures and colours in the worn surface and I like it against the other texture of the wall/ground. The shadow is good too.', '2007-12-19 17:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324089, 623152, 75192, '<td valign="top">A great natural picture.</td>', 'A great natural picture.', '2007-12-19 17:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324090, 622610, 83328, '<td valign="top">seems like the door is tilted...</td>', 'seems like the door is tilted...', '2007-12-19 17:33:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4324091, 623606, 3087, '<td valign="top">How intriguing that this brown, dried and snow-covered flower/bulb shoots towards us from a green and living stem with other growing bulbs and a green background behind. So interesting.</td>', 'How intriguing that this brown, dried and snow-covered flower/bulb shoots towards us from a green and living stem with other growing bulbs and a green background behind. So interesting.', '2007-12-19 17:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324092, 622180, 75192, '<td valign="top">Something about this picture makes me want to go down the path inbetween the trees. <br/> <br/>I like it :)</td>', 'Something about this picture makes me want to go down the path inbetween the trees.  I like it :)', '2007-12-19 17:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324093, 623274, 75192, '<td valign="top">Great tones and composition.</td>', 'Great tones and composition.', '2007-12-19 17:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324095, 623024, 3087, '<td valign="top">That single, rusted, fire-ravaged nail in the charcoaled wood is just the perfect focal point. I love the way that there is so much more beauty in the colours and textures and shapes of the burned item than there would ever have been in the item when fresh and new!</td>', 'That single, rusted, fire-ravaged nail in the charcoaled wood is just the perfect focal point. I love the way that there is so much more beauty in the colours and textures and shapes of the burned item than there would ever have been in the item when fresh and new!', '2007-12-19 17:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324096, 623880, 83328, '<td valign="top">seems a little too dark overall...</td>', 'seems a little too dark overall...', '2007-12-19 17:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324097, 623274, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and textures, a nice low viewpoint, good composition. I like it!</td>', 'Lovely colours and textures, a nice low viewpoint, good composition. I like it!', '2007-12-19 17:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324107, 623726, 83328, '<td valign="top">nice capture, although the background is a little distracting</td>', 'nice capture, although the background is a little distracting', '2007-12-19 17:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324119, 622228, 85102, '<td valign="top">This isn''t beauty in my eyes, but its a great quality picture!</td>', 'This isn''t beauty in my eyes, but its a great quality picture!', '2007-12-19 17:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324123, 623598, 3087, '<td valign="top">The texture of the frost has lifted this everyday detail into something so beautiful. Your composition is just perfect too. Beautiful, beautiful image.</td>', 'The texture of the frost has lifted this everyday detail into something so beautiful. Your composition is just perfect too. Beautiful, beautiful image.', '2007-12-19 17:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324129, 622910, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an idiosynchratic item and this is a great portrait of it. I really love your lighting and choice of shallow DOF which have combined to work their magic on the strings and the little bokeh circles of reflected light. The colours and textures of the paintwork are beautifully presented.</td>', 'Wow, what an idiosynchratic item and this is a great portrait of it. I really love your lighting and choice of shallow DOF which have combined to work their magic on the strings and the little bokeh circles of reflected light. The colours and textures of the paintwork are beautifully presented.', '2007-12-19 17:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324130, 623665, 3087, '<td valign="top">Minimalism at it''s best. A fabulous high-key image with such very simple lines - both the curve of the bump and the sweeping line below are integral to the composition. Very zen.</td>', 'Minimalism at it''s best. A fabulous high-key image with such very simple lines - both the curve of the bump and the sweeping line below are integral to the composition. Very zen.', '2007-12-19 17:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324132, 622380, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this. The shapes, textures, colours and composition work well. The subject is intriguing, clearly man-made but not sure entirely what it is - perhaps a segment of an old buoy or fishing boat rope that has washed ashore. That fits well with the description of wabi-sabi which I think is missing in many entries.</td>', 'I like this. The shapes, textures, colours and composition work well. The subject is intriguing, clearly man-made but not sure entirely what it is - perhaps a segment of an old buoy or fishing boat rope that has washed ashore. That fits well with the description of wabi-sabi which I think is missing in many entries.', '2007-12-19 17:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324137, 623227, 43774, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2007-12-19 17:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324138, 622057, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the light on white and the simplicity of this photo. The wooden tools and pottery go well together.</td>', 'I like the light on white and the simplicity of this photo. The wooden tools and pottery go well together.', '2007-12-19 17:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324139, 623061, 43774, '<td valign="top">An everyday scene but beautiful. Well done.</td>', 'An everyday scene but beautiful. Well done.', '2007-12-19 17:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324140, 623334, 43774, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo to be sure. I think that arch is extraordinary and I would love to see it in person. The birds add a nice element to the photo. This has the look of an infrared photo but it could just be frost or ice on the trees.</td>', 'A beautiful photo to be sure. I think that arch is extraordinary and I would love to see it in person. The birds add a nice element to the photo. This has the look of an infrared photo but it could just be frost or ice on the trees.', '2007-12-19 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324141, 623618, 43774, '<td valign="top">So sharp and clear, interesting and wonderful composition.</td>', 'So sharp and clear, interesting and wonderful composition.', '2007-12-19 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324142, 623383, 43774, '<td valign="top">Really nice. I love photos of birds in the snow.</td>', 'Really nice. I love photos of birds in the snow.', '2007-12-19 17:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324144, 623220, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! This is a weed, right? Excellent perspective and colour, perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful! This is a weed, right? Excellent perspective and colour, perfect for the challenge.', '2007-12-19 17:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324145, 623606, 43774, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous bokeh here, tack sharp and composed very well.</td>', 'Gorgeous bokeh here, tack sharp and composed very well.', '2007-12-19 17:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4324146, 623844, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is so sweet</td>', 'This is so sweet', '2007-12-19 17:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
