(4324707, 623259, 84907, '<td valign="top">You have to love an old trumpet and a beat up case.  Great take on the challenge.  I like the way you used the light.  Additionally it is difficult to balance light without blowing the highlights completely out on a shiny subject like a trumpet, and I think you did a great job keeping that pretty well balanced.  My one area of critique is the crop.  Cutting off the bottom left of the case pretty clearly takes away from the image.  Still a great shot  :)</td>', 'You have to love an old trumpet and a beat up case.  Great take on the challenge.  I like the way you used the light.  Additionally it is difficult to balance light without blowing the highlights completely out on a shiny subject like a trumpet, and I think you did a great job keeping that pretty well balanced.  My one area of critique is the crop.  Cutting off the bottom left of the case pretty clearly takes away from the image.  Still a great shot  :)', '2007-12-19 21:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
