(4325097, 623338, 84907, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like that.  Great use of the everyday and the background of the aged wood is just perfect for the shot.  Sometimes less is more and I think you did a really really nice job with this shot.</td>', 'Oh, I like that.  Great use of the everyday and the background of the aged wood is just perfect for the shot.  Sometimes less is more and I think you did a really really nice job with this shot.', '2007-12-20 00:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325104, 623726, 85849, '<td valign="top">This shot is quite nice. So many don''t meet the challenge. This is beauty in imperfection, made from nature and so delicate that a strong wind could easily destroy it. The water beads truly look like pearls.</td>', 'This shot is quite nice. So many don''t meet the challenge. This is beauty in imperfection, made from nature and so delicate that a strong wind could easily destroy it. The water beads truly look like pearls.', '2007-12-20 00:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
