(4325397, 623867, 60173, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that my first thought was that the jewel was out of focus. In the time it took me to sip my coffee, I started to appreciate the depth a bit more.<br/> <br/>This photo is actually quite funny. I really like how the chain is laid leading back to the jewel. This is very well presented. I hope others stop to take a second glance.</td>', 'I have to admit that my first thought was that the jewel was out of focus. In the time it took me to sip my coffee, I started to appreciate the depth a bit more. This photo is actually quite funny. I really like how the chain is laid leading back to the jewel. This is very well presented. I hope others stop to take a second glance.', '2007-12-20 06:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325400, 623516, 66597, '<td valign="top">This looks really good, Deb. In fact, I was tempted to hit the "7" button when I went through. Sorry I can''t vote here...</td>', 'This looks really good, Deb. In fact, I was tempted to hit the "7" button when I went through. Sorry I can''t vote here...', '2007-12-20 06:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325417, 623671, 66597, '<td valign="top">For a Lovely Bowl<br/>Arrange This Autumn Flower<br/>Since There is No Rice<br/> <br/>-Slight Modification of Haiku by Japanese Poet Basho</td>', 'For a Lovely BowlArrange This Autumn FlowerSince There is No Rice -Slight Modification of Haiku by Japanese Poet Basho', '2007-12-20 07:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325420, 622284, 60173, '<td valign="top">Your exposure is great, and your focus is dead on. <br/> <br/>Unfortunately I can''t say the image does much for me. Without reading the title I wouldn''t know that the flame is your focus.<br/> <br/>While I appreciate the simplicity and minimalism of the background, I don''t think it adds anything. I think you could get away with a much tighter crop and accomplish the minimalism effect you''re going for. As it is right now, there''s so much black that it''s competing with your lone flame.</td>', 'Your exposure is great, and your focus is dead on.  Unfortunately I can''t say the image does much for me. Without reading the title I wouldn''t know that the flame is your focus. While I appreciate the simplicity and minimalism of the background, I don''t think it adds anything. I think you could get away with a much tighter crop and accomplish the minimalism effect you''re going for. As it is right now, there''s so much black that it''s competing with your lone flame.', '2007-12-20 07:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325434, 623748, 60173, '<td valign="top">I love the muted colors of this. The reflections and shadows are great, and the textures have great depth and interest.<br/> <br/>With that said I don''t like the crop, heh. It seems too tall to me. I copied it into Photoshop and played with some different crops. I found that cutting a bit off the bottom, a bit off the top, and a bit off the left side added more punch to the photo (a bit = about 1/4 of an inch).</td>', 'I love the muted colors of this. The reflections and shadows are great, and the textures have great depth and interest. With that said I don''t like the crop, heh. It seems too tall to me. I copied it into Photoshop and played with some different crops. I found that cutting a bit off the bottom, a bit off the top, and a bit off the left side added more punch to the photo (a bit = about 1/4 of an inch).', '2007-12-20 07:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325446, 623433, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well seen, well captured!</td>', 'Well seen, well captured!', '2007-12-20 07:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325447, 622918, 30982, '<td valign="top">This speaks volumes to me.  It''s my kinda thing, it''s extremely well done.  The quiet sadness represented by a lone chair left in the wonderful expanse of gray snow.  That bit of light and shadow is just perfect.</td>', 'This speaks volumes to me.  It''s my kinda thing, it''s extremely well done.  The quiet sadness represented by a lone chair left in the wonderful expanse of gray snow.  That bit of light and shadow is just perfect.', '2007-12-20 07:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325448, 623618, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very lovely and appropriate choice for the challenge.  Excellent detail in the leaf; I like the very faint reflection, too.</td>', 'A very lovely and appropriate choice for the challenge.  Excellent detail in the leaf; I like the very faint reflection, too.', '2007-12-20 07:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325449, 621945, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful imperfections and I love your choice of toning.</td>', 'Beautiful imperfections and I love your choice of toning.', '2007-12-20 07:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325453, 623461, 30982, '<td valign="top">Normally a shot of a single bird might not do it for me for this challenge, but the way this is presented most definitely meets the challenge.  I love that the bird itself is not sharp - it''s fluid and blurred and quite lovely.  The motion can be felt.  I love that the background is a background.  I even like that the bird is centered.  It speaks of transience, of beauty, of simple grace.</td>', 'Normally a shot of a single bird might not do it for me for this challenge, but the way this is presented most definitely meets the challenge.  I love that the bird itself is not sharp - it''s fluid and blurred and quite lovely.  The motion can be felt.  I love that the background is a background.  I even like that the bird is centered.  It speaks of transience, of beauty, of simple grace.', '2007-12-20 07:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325455, 623851, 30982, '<td valign="top">If I were to guess, I would think this might be Colleen''s.  (And if not, take it as a compliment just the same!)  I love the way the berries reach out - almost literally out of time.  Exquisite composition and light.</td>', 'If I were to guess, I would think this might be Colleen''s.  (And if not, take it as a compliment just the same!)  I love the way the berries reach out - almost literally out of time.  Exquisite composition and light.', '2007-12-20 07:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325460, 623383, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a compelling picture to me - sure it''s a great picture of a bluejay, but it''s the snow, the gray, and the cock of the head by the bird that adds something extra.</td>', 'This is a compelling picture to me - sure it''s a great picture of a bluejay, but it''s the snow, the gray, and the cock of the head by the bird that adds something extra.', '2007-12-20 07:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325466, 623511, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely understated.</td>', 'Nicely understated.', '2007-12-20 07:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325468, 622938, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a great shot.  I love the bokeh, the grays, the hints of pink.  And the sense of wonder.</td>', 'Wow - what a great shot.  I love the bokeh, the grays, the hints of pink.  And the sense of wonder.', '2007-12-20 07:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4325471, 623645, 30982, '<td valign="top">While this may be an artistic choice on your part, I find the pixelation, noise, and lack of light on the face to be a deterrent to seeing the beauty in the shot.  Great smile, though!</td>', 'While this may be an artistic choice on your part, I find the pixelation, noise, and lack of light on the face to be a deterrent to seeing the beauty in the shot.  Great smile, though!', '2007-12-20 08:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
