(4325564, 623329, 80859, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure why you cropped the top of the bottle off, maybe something about the way it looked didn''t fit the rest of the photo, but it kind of bothers me because my eyes keep trying to follow it beyond the photo.  i also think the rug should have removed from behind, otherwise i would have given it a 10. the floor demonstrates my understanding of ''wabi-sabi'' absolutely perfectly and i like the way it fades off into the darkness.  and i love the overall colour of the photo.  the flower is a beautiful touch.  /9</td>', 'i''m not sure why you cropped the top of the bottle off, maybe something about the way it looked didn''t fit the rest of the photo, but it kind of bothers me because my eyes keep trying to follow it beyond the photo.  i also think the rug should have removed from behind, otherwise i would have given it a 10. the floor demonstrates my understanding of ''wabi-sabi'' absolutely perfectly and i like the way it fades off into the darkness.  and i love the overall colour of the photo.  the flower is a beautiful touch.  /9', '2007-12-20 08:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
