(4326998, 623371, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s an amusing everyday scene, but I don''t see beautiful imperfections that would make it fit the description of Wabi-Sabi.<br/> <br/>I do like the shot, though. Good comp and the use of b/w works well.</td>', 'It''s an amusing everyday scene, but I don''t see beautiful imperfections that would make it fit the description of Wabi-Sabi. I do like the shot, though. Good comp and the use of b/w works well.', '2007-12-20 21:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
