(4327025, 623687, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cattails are everyday, but to me, this is not an everyday image of one. It is debatable if this subject fits the Wabi-Sabi concept. I have to say that I really like it, even if I don''t think it totally fits the challenge. An 8 and a fave.</td>', 'Cattails are everyday, but to me, this is not an everyday image of one. It is debatable if this subject fits the Wabi-Sabi concept. I have to say that I really like it, even if I don''t think it totally fits the challenge. An 8 and a fave.', '2007-12-20 21:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327029, 622931, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wow. What a view. Only problem I can see with this is two wonderful, but separate subjects competing for my eyeballs.</td>', 'Wow. What a view. Only problem I can see with this is two wonderful, but separate subjects competing for my eyeballs.', '2007-12-20 21:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327032, 623818, 83313, '<td valign="top">Where''s my big tall glass of iced tea to go with this?</td>', 'Where''s my big tall glass of iced tea to go with this?', '2007-12-20 21:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327038, 623337, 83313, '<td valign="top">This could have been a boring shot, but I think you tweaked the colors just right to bring out a lot of texture and visual interest.</td>', 'This could have been a boring shot, but I think you tweaked the colors just right to bring out a lot of texture and visual interest.', '2007-12-20 21:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327041, 623858, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oooohhhh... Ahhhhhhh... Wowwwwww! Of course I have to love those bold clouds, but I also like the barely visible tumbleweeds.</td>', 'Oooohhhh... Ahhhhhhh... Wowwwwww! Of course I have to love those bold clouds, but I also like the barely visible tumbleweeds.', '2007-12-20 21:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327042, 623819, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, glowing morning mist. Composition leads my eye to just the right spot on the foremost boat.</td>', 'Wonderful, glowing morning mist. Composition leads my eye to just the right spot on the foremost boat.', '2007-12-20 21:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327044, 622358, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like the texture and perspective. Not sure whether it fits the Wabi-Sabi idea or not, but I like it.</td>', 'I really like the texture and perspective. Not sure whether it fits the Wabi-Sabi idea or not, but I like it.', '2007-12-20 21:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327050, 622406, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost. It strikes me as very busy with multiple subjects trying to draw my eye. Not sure that it fits the Wabi-Sabi idea.</td>', 'Almost. It strikes me as very busy with multiple subjects trying to draw my eye. Not sure that it fits the Wabi-Sabi idea.', '2007-12-20 21:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327052, 623464, 83313, '<td valign="top">Most definitely fits the theme, thought the shot does not have impact for me. Perhaps some tweaking of curves and contrast could help. I also think it is too dead centered.</td>', 'Most definitely fits the theme, thought the shot does not have impact for me. Perhaps some tweaking of curves and contrast could help. I also think it is too dead centered.', '2007-12-20 21:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327053, 622938, 75424, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful, but it does not fit the challenge description of the "everyday...the ordinary"</td>', 'this is beautiful, but it does not fit the challenge description of the "everyday...the ordinary"', '2007-12-20 21:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327055, 623650, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is great. Nice colors, comp and the title fits well. A 9 and a Fave.</td>', 'This is great. Nice colors, comp and the title fits well. A 9 and a Fave.', '2007-12-20 21:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327056, 622567, 75424, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful, but it does not fit the challenge description of the "everyday...the ordinary"</td>', 'this is beautiful, but it does not fit the challenge description of the "everyday...the ordinary"', '2007-12-20 21:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327059, 622931, 75424, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful, but it does not fit the challenge description of the "everyday...the ordinary"</td>', 'this is beautiful, but it does not fit the challenge description of the "everyday...the ordinary"', '2007-12-20 21:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327061, 623385, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can tell everyone who lives up north. Lots of snow shots this week! A decent snow scene, and well composed, but it does not have impact for me.</td>', 'I can tell everyone who lives up north. Lots of snow shots this week! A decent snow scene, and well composed, but it does not have impact for me.', '2007-12-20 21:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327062, 623705, 75424, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful, but it does not fit the challenge description of the "everyday...the ordinary"</td>', 'this is beautiful, but it does not fit the challenge description of the "everyday...the ordinary"', '2007-12-20 21:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327064, 622763, 83313, '<td valign="top">This was almost exactly what I was envisioning when i read the definition of Wabi-Sabi. Other than the composition seeming a little forced, this is great.</td>', 'This was almost exactly what I was envisioning when i read the definition of Wabi-Sabi. Other than the composition seeming a little forced, this is great.', '2007-12-20 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327092, 622149, 208, '<td valign="top">The crack isn''t an imperfection, it''s a defect. The egg can''t do its job with that kind of damage. Had you left it alone and concentrated on those little bumps on the surface, the photo would have fit better with the "wabi-sabi" concept. As for the shot itself, I like it. It seems a bit dull - too much gray and not enough white to balance the black shadow under the spoon. I also like the frame you''ve made with the border and the DOF of the spoon.</td>', 'The crack isn''t an imperfection, it''s a defect. The egg can''t do its job with that kind of damage. Had you left it alone and concentrated on those little bumps on the surface, the photo would have fit better with the "wabi-sabi" concept. As for the shot itself, I like it. It seems a bit dull - too much gray and not enough white to balance the black shadow under the spoon. I also like the frame you''ve made with the border and the DOF of the spoon.', '2007-12-20 22:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327120, 623606, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love so much about this - the juxtaposition of the dead flower and the buds, the snow and the green, past and future ... and that little bit of snow precariously perched on the edge of the flower that will bring an imminent change in the scene, while the plant more slowly experiences its changes.  Fabulous take on the challenge, IMO, and my favorite entry.</td>', 'I love so much about this - the juxtaposition of the dead flower and the buds, the snow and the green, past and future ... and that little bit of snow precariously perched on the edge of the flower that will bring an imminent change in the scene, while the plant more slowly experiences its changes.  Fabulous take on the challenge, IMO, and my favorite entry.', '2007-12-20 22:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327128, 622790, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a lovely idea, and the golden light bathing the couple is so very appropriate to the mood and your title.  I also like the contrast between the straight, evenly spaced trees in formation and the slightly stooped couple who are far more interesting in their asymmetry and motion.</td>', 'What a lovely idea, and the golden light bathing the couple is so very appropriate to the mood and your title.  I also like the contrast between the straight, evenly spaced trees in formation and the slightly stooped couple who are far more interesting in their asymmetry and motion.', '2007-12-20 22:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327133, 623251, 65234, '<td valign="top">I think you deserve a great score just for having such a poetic title!  But I also like your image, and would even without the poetry.  The frozen drops of water with the little lines and bubbles are lovely, and the background color nicely sets off the blackened leaves.</td>', 'I think you deserve a great score just for having such a poetic title!  But I also like your image, and would even without the poetry.  The frozen drops of water with the little lines and bubbles are lovely, and the background color nicely sets off the blackened leaves.', '2007-12-20 22:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327141, 623812, 65234, '<td valign="top">The frost does a great job of making a shriveled old apple look lovely, and the ice-covered buds are quite beautiful to me.  I like the contrast of the shriveled apple, the apparently whole apple, and the buds showing multiple aspects of the tree''s life at once.</td>', 'The frost does a great job of making a shriveled old apple look lovely, and the ice-covered buds are quite beautiful to me.  I like the contrast of the shriveled apple, the apparently whole apple, and the buds showing multiple aspects of the tree''s life at once.', '2007-12-20 22:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327143, 623668, 65234, '<td valign="top">Some sort of moth?  On a cactus?  Not something I ordinarily see (moths seem indifferent to my cacti) but it makes for a pretty picture.</td>', 'Some sort of moth?  On a cactus?  Not something I ordinarily see (moths seem indifferent to my cacti) but it makes for a pretty picture.', '2007-12-20 22:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327147, 623726, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Just beautiful.  I think your angle, light and DOF are perfect for making those water drops look gorgeously 3-dimensional.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Just beautiful.  I think your angle, light and DOF are perfect for making those water drops look gorgeously 3-dimensional.', '2007-12-20 23:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327155, 623274, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not going to try and google the title, so I''ll just comment on the image, which is wonderful.  The leaf looks fragile and beautiful and ready to blow away any second.  The blues and greens complement it nicely, and the look of peeling paint and carved graffiti enhance the aged look and feel of the scene.</td>', 'Not going to try and google the title, so I''ll just comment on the image, which is wonderful.  The leaf looks fragile and beautiful and ready to blow away any second.  The blues and greens complement it nicely, and the look of peeling paint and carved graffiti enhance the aged look and feel of the scene.', '2007-12-20 23:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327159, 622433, 65234, '<td valign="top">Marvelous detail, and cardinals are such a lovely part of a winter scene, even if they are "common."  Wish you had his tail in the picture, but still a wonderful image.</td>', 'Marvelous detail, and cardinals are such a lovely part of a winter scene, even if they are "common."  Wish you had his tail in the picture, but still a wonderful image.', '2007-12-20 23:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327188, 623355, 65234, '<td valign="top">Bit of settling occurred over time, eh?  Give it another year and the ivy will cover both parts of the lock!  Nice subject for this.  Love the rust and weathered look; could use maybe a touch more DOF to get the right side lock part (uh, the slidey bit) in sharper focus.</td>', 'Bit of settling occurred over time, eh?  Give it another year and the ivy will cover both parts of the lock!  Nice subject for this.  Love the rust and weathered look; could use maybe a touch more DOF to get the right side lock part (uh, the slidey bit) in sharper focus.', '2007-12-20 23:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327189, 623660, 65234, '<td valign="top">The diagonal composition and cool tones are quite lovely, and I like that the posts and rope are worn, the trees aren''t perfectly sheared, and even the snow isn''t perfect.</td>', 'The diagonal composition and cool tones are quite lovely, and I like that the posts and rope are worn, the trees aren''t perfectly sheared, and even the snow isn''t perfect.', '2007-12-20 23:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327192, 623650, 65234, '<td valign="top">Rather a sad title :-(  But don''t worry; if you save the seeds you can plant more flowers next year (assuming it''s not some weird sterile hybrid).  I like the detail showing the lovely icy crystals and the drooping, fading petals.  It looks just a touch softer than I expect at the center of the flower.</td>', 'Rather a sad title :-(  But don''t worry; if you save the seeds you can plant more flowers next year (assuming it''s not some weird sterile hybrid).  I like the detail showing the lovely icy crystals and the drooping, fading petals.  It looks just a touch softer than I expect at the center of the flower.', '2007-12-20 23:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327193, 623865, 65234, '<td valign="top">I adore the composition and lighting.  Simple and so very lovely to my eyes.  But (and it''s a pretty big "but") it looks awfully oversaturated on my monitor.   I can''t tell you how much I wish that weren''t the case!!!  Also, it could use maybe a bit more contrast to get rid of the halo around the light bulb.</td>', 'I adore the composition and lighting.  Simple and so very lovely to my eyes.  But (and it''s a pretty big "but") it looks awfully oversaturated on my monitor.   I can''t tell you how much I wish that weren''t the case!!!  Also, it could use maybe a bit more contrast to get rid of the halo around the light bulb.', '2007-12-20 23:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327195, 623493, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice find!  The reflections show a person and blue sky, while the background is pure black ... the discrpancy is a bit distracting from the car itself.</td>', 'Nice find!  The reflections show a person and blue sky, while the background is pure black ... the discrpancy is a bit distracting from the car itself.', '2007-12-20 23:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327199, 622694, 65234, '<td valign="top">I keep trying to figure out why I like this so much.  I think because it''s just so incredibly random-looking, with this beautifully colored feather in a tiny spider web on a decaying log, and detail in all the right places to appreciate it.  I''m not sure I like the dark space and white blotch on the right so much, but I''m not sure I''d crop it, either.  I suspect I will come back and ponder this one some more because it intrigues me!</td>', 'I keep trying to figure out why I like this so much.  I think because it''s just so incredibly random-looking, with this beautifully colored feather in a tiny spider web on a decaying log, and detail in all the right places to appreciate it.  I''m not sure I like the dark space and white blotch on the right so much, but I''m not sure I''d crop it, either.  I suspect I will come back and ponder this one some more because it intrigues me!', '2007-12-20 23:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327203, 622705, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is a cool looking shot. Not sure whether it fits the Wabi-Sabi concept or not, but I like it.</td>', 'This is a cool looking shot. Not sure whether it fits the Wabi-Sabi concept or not, but I like it.', '2007-12-20 23:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327204, 623844, 65234, '<td valign="top">Without the little fake lights this would have looked real enough to more closely meet my idea of the challenge.  But frankly the birds around here are slouches in the decorating department, so while pretty, this is definitely not something I see ... well, ever.  Nicely done shot, though.</td>', 'Without the little fake lights this would have looked real enough to more closely meet my idea of the challenge.  But frankly the birds around here are slouches in the decorating department, so while pretty, this is definitely not something I see ... well, ever.  Nicely done shot, though.', '2007-12-20 23:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327207, 622649, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of a brick wall.  Looks like perfect rule of thirds composition, and nicely imperfect bricks, besides.</td>', 'Very nice shot of a brick wall.  Looks like perfect rule of thirds composition, and nicely imperfect bricks, besides.', '2007-12-20 23:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327209, 623860, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the shape of the leaf and the diagonal leading line of the pipe.  Nice, subdued tones, too.</td>', 'I like the shape of the leaf and the diagonal leading line of the pipe.  Nice, subdued tones, too.', '2007-12-20 23:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327212, 623324, 65234, '<td valign="top">The stones are nice, but the lighting is creating quite a bit of glare.</td>', 'The stones are nice, but the lighting is creating quite a bit of glare.', '2007-12-20 23:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327213, 623728, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether to give you a high score for thinking outside the box, or a lousy one for DNMC...<br/> <br/>I think you''ll get lower midrange score for misspelling "every" and "beauty". Gotta love it, though.</td>', 'I don''t know whether to give you a high score for thinking outside the box, or a lousy one for DNMC... I think you''ll get lower midrange score for misspelling "every" and "beauty". Gotta love it, though.', '2007-12-20 23:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327216, 622873, 65234, '<td valign="top">The scene is common in some places, I know, but there is so much plain, bright white here I am having trouble seeing much beauty in it.</td>', 'The scene is common in some places, I know, but there is so much plain, bright white here I am having trouble seeing much beauty in it.', '2007-12-20 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327217, 623671, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wow. I love this. A great image and it fits the theme to a "T".</td>', 'Wow. I love this. A great image and it fits the theme to a "T".', '2007-12-20 23:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327220, 622319, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s beautiful and an everyday scene, but I just don''t see it fitting the Wabi-Sabi idea.</td>', 'It''s beautiful and an everyday scene, but I just don''t see it fitting the Wabi-Sabi idea.', '2007-12-20 23:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327221, 623877, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not a Wabi-Sabi image, but it''s cute.</td>', 'Not a Wabi-Sabi image, but it''s cute.', '2007-12-20 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327222, 623728, 65234, '<td valign="top">Literal (though often misspelled) take on the challenge, but not terribly appealing to me photographically.</td>', 'Literal (though often misspelled) take on the challenge, but not terribly appealing to me photographically.', '2007-12-20 23:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327223, 623821, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not a Wabi-Sabi image, but it''s very cute.  This baby looks like it''s having fun. The camera is probably quite fascinating.</td>', 'Not a Wabi-Sabi image, but it''s very cute.  This baby looks like it''s having fun. The camera is probably quite fascinating.', '2007-12-20 23:45:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4327225, 622649, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice details, wish it had better DOF though.</td>', 'Nice details, wish it had better DOF though.', '2007-12-20 23:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327226, 623700, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fits the theme and a decent shot, but not much impact for me. It''s like I am expecting something additional in the image that is not there.</td>', 'Fits the theme and a decent shot, but not much impact for me. It''s like I am expecting something additional in the image that is not there.', '2007-12-20 23:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327227, 623862, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and I like the sunset glow. There is some distortion, but that may have been an intentional element of this photo.</td>', 'Nicely composed and I like the sunset glow. There is some distortion, but that may have been an intentional element of this photo.', '2007-12-20 23:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327229, 623227, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. I think I''m dizzy now.</td>', 'Nice perspective. I think I''m dizzy now.', '2007-12-20 23:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327232, 623748, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the partial desaturation, and the graininess looks good on the green pot. Composition may be a little too balanced.</td>', 'I like the partial desaturation, and the graininess looks good on the green pot. Composition may be a little too balanced.', '2007-12-20 23:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327239, 622358, 86895, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I think it would have been good for the perspective challange too!</td>', 'Great shot.  I think it would have been good for the perspective challange too!', '2007-12-20 23:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327240, 623282, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s everyday, but I don''t see beautiful imperfections that would make it fit the description of Wabi-Sabi. Lots of impact though. This would do well if the subject was advertising.</td>', 'It''s everyday, but I don''t see beautiful imperfections that would make it fit the description of Wabi-Sabi. Lots of impact though. This would do well if the subject was advertising.', '2007-12-20 23:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327241, 623625, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty. A sweet everyday scene, but I just don''t see it fitting the Wabi-Sabi idea.</td>', 'Cute kitty. A sweet everyday scene, but I just don''t see it fitting the Wabi-Sabi idea.', '2007-12-20 23:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327247, 623671, 82816, '<td valign="top">awesome shot... really refreshing to see someone take a chance with this challenge. great capture and i hope you do well.</td>', 'awesome shot... really refreshing to see someone take a chance with this challenge. great capture and i hope you do well.', '2007-12-20 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327259, 623806, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and detail in this. The zoom blur works too.</td>', 'I really like the color and detail in this. The zoom blur works too.', '2007-12-21 00:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327262, 622987, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t care for it. It looks like an effort to save a blurry shot. On the other hand, that imperfection may make it fit the definition of Wabi-Sabi by it''s very nature. Oh, the drama...</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t care for it. It looks like an effort to save a blurry shot. On the other hand, that imperfection may make it fit the definition of Wabi-Sabi by it''s very nature. Oh, the drama...', '2007-12-21 00:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327264, 622816, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is this an artificial hand?</td>', 'Is this an artificial hand?', '2007-12-21 00:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327268, 622763, 87502, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photograph; however, the wikipedia article about Wabi Sabi specifically mentions Japanese tea bowls.  I wish you would have pushed your creative impetus.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photograph; however, the wikipedia article about Wabi Sabi specifically mentions Japanese tea bowls.  I wish you would have pushed your creative impetus.', '2007-12-21 00:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327362, 622951, 22390, '<td valign="top">There are too many distracting elements in the picture, but I like the way they look at each other.</td>', 'There are too many distracting elements in the picture, but I like the way they look at each other.', '2007-12-21 02:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327365, 622200, 22390, '<td valign="top">Pleasant lighting. Well done.</td>', 'Pleasant lighting. Well done.', '2007-12-21 02:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327370, 623728, 22390, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t think this meets the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t think this meets the challenge.', '2007-12-21 02:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327371, 623739, 22390, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2007-12-21 02:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327373, 622149, 22390, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the lighting is great !</td>', 'I like the composition and the lighting is great !', '2007-12-21 02:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327375, 623355, 22390, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures, but the leaf in the lower left corner is distracting.</td>', 'Interesting textures, but the leaf in the lower left corner is distracting.', '2007-12-21 02:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327378, 621897, 22390, '<td valign="top">Nice textures.</td>', 'Nice textures.', '2007-12-21 02:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327381, 622873, 22390, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t like very much those huge white areas without any details.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t like very much those huge white areas without any details.', '2007-12-21 02:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327392, 622493, 22390, '<td valign="top">It must be a very difficult photo to take. I find the right eye of the cat out of focus, and the left one too dark.</td>', 'It must be a very difficult photo to take. I find the right eye of the cat out of focus, and the left one too dark.', '2007-12-21 03:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327395, 623744, 22390, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. The power lines are distracting, but there''s not much you could do about that.</td>', 'Nice picture. The power lines are distracting, but there''s not much you could do about that.', '2007-12-21 03:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327396, 623383, 22390, '<td valign="top">Very good picture.</td>', 'Very good picture.', '2007-12-21 03:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327399, 623414, 22390, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The picture seems a bit soft though.</td>', 'I like the composition. The picture seems a bit soft though.', '2007-12-21 03:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327400, 623686, 54778, '<td valign="top">really like the composition.. the skin seems slightly oversaturated though...</td>', 'really like the composition.. the skin seems slightly oversaturated though...', '2007-12-21 03:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327401, 622625, 54778, '<td valign="top">the plainess of the composition is really nice.. like how the textures are brought out..</td>', 'the plainess of the composition is really nice.. like how the textures are brought out..', '2007-12-21 03:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327402, 623671, 54778, '<td valign="top">the composition works well but the pic seems overexposed because of the sharpening/reflections and a little too oversaturated..</td>', 'the composition works well but the pic seems overexposed because of the sharpening/reflections and a little too oversaturated..', '2007-12-21 03:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327403, 623256, 54778, '<td valign="top">This would have been a better picture if the lower half wasn''t so dark and there was some more light or clouds to give the viewer something to look at..</td>', 'This would have been a better picture if the lower half wasn''t so dark and there was some more light or clouds to give the viewer something to look at..', '2007-12-21 03:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327405, 623032, 22390, '<td valign="top">I find the picture a bit dark and a bit soft.</td>', 'I find the picture a bit dark and a bit soft.', '2007-12-21 03:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327406, 623561, 54778, '<td valign="top">like the blue tones and the composition..</td>', 'like the blue tones and the composition..', '2007-12-21 03:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4327408, 622626, 54778, '<td valign="top">the pic seems a bit out of focus and that distracts from the good composition.. and the border is a no no..</td>', 'the pic seems a bit out of focus and that distracts from the good composition.. and the border is a no no..', '2007-12-21 03:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
