(4328412, 622945, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s everyday, but I don''t see beautiful imperfections that would make it fit the description of Wabi-Sabi. It is a nice image though, with an interesting perspective.</td>', 'It''s everyday, but I don''t see beautiful imperfections that would make it fit the description of Wabi-Sabi. It is a nice image though, with an interesting perspective.', '2007-12-21 13:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
