(4329084, 623851, 88010, '<td valign="top">Well the idea is nice. I like the shallow dof and the colors are good. But I think we have too much subject, or too many subjects. I''m not sure if the blue berries or the red berries are the subject.</td>', 'Well the idea is nice. I like the shallow dof and the colors are good. But I think we have too much subject, or too many subjects. I''m not sure if the blue berries or the red berries are the subject.', '2007-12-21 19:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
