(4329124, 622754, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the comp and colors. I''m curious what that blurred X shape in the background is. twigs?</td>', 'I like the comp and colors. I''m curious what that blurred X shape in the background is. twigs?', '2007-12-21 19:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
