(4329128, 622918, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title, but this looks like it is placed in a snowbank? Aha I see (duh). It was there before the snow fell.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title, but this looks like it is placed in a snowbank? Aha I see (duh). It was there before the snow fell.', '2007-12-21 19:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329130, 623329, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not only does it totally fit the challenge, and is a good photo, but it has a strong message as well. Excellent.</td>', 'Not only does it totally fit the challenge, and is a good photo, but it has a strong message as well. Excellent.', '2007-12-21 19:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329133, 623513, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the texture in this. The sand looks warm. A change from all the snow shots from our northern members!</td>', 'I like the texture in this. The sand looks warm. A change from all the snow shots from our northern members!', '2007-12-21 19:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329134, 622494, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of neat. Looks like someone bent over carrying a heavy crate on their shoulders.</td>', 'Kind of neat. Looks like someone bent over carrying a heavy crate on their shoulders.', '2007-12-21 19:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329142, 623251, 88010, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see a bit more detail in the leaves, but quite nice. I must admit I''ve seen many drops at the end of leaves, but don''t know that I''ve ever seen a pic of them frozen in a row in a composition like this. Nice backdrop. Well done.</td>', 'I wish I could see a bit more detail in the leaves, but quite nice. I must admit I''ve seen many drops at the end of leaves, but don''t know that I''ve ever seen a pic of them frozen in a row in a composition like this. Nice backdrop. Well done.', '2007-12-21 20:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329144, 623357, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice side lighting . I wish it had a little more dof though because with such nice lighting it''s a shame to not get to appreciate all the wonderfully shadowed shapes.</td>', 'Nice side lighting . I wish it had a little more dof though because with such nice lighting it''s a shame to not get to appreciate all the wonderfully shadowed shapes.', '2007-12-21 20:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329153, 623806, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but a little to narrow dof for me. I would like to see less blurr on the right corner.</td>', 'Nice capture but a little to narrow dof for me. I would like to see less blurr on the right corner.', '2007-12-21 20:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329154, 623451, 88010, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and background but the redness is a bit much. Warm tones are nice, but overdone here.</td>', 'Interesting subject and background but the redness is a bit much. Warm tones are nice, but overdone here.', '2007-12-21 20:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329155, 623516, 88010, '<td valign="top">As I cropped down and lost the handle I found this to be a nice abstract. But with the handle, not so much.</td>', 'As I cropped down and lost the handle I found this to be a nice abstract. But with the handle, not so much.', '2007-12-21 20:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329157, 623061, 88010, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice. Finally someone that undeerstands that the shadows in snow on a sunny day are BLUE. I had an argument about that once. Glad you agree :)</td>', 'Simple and nice. Finally someone that undeerstands that the shadows in snow on a sunny day are BLUE. I had an argument about that once. Glad you agree :)', '2007-12-21 20:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329158, 623126, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice change to do a super macro. Not sure I care for the lighting, it makes the details indistinct. but otherwise it''s good.</td>', 'Nice change to do a super macro. Not sure I care for the lighting, it makes the details indistinct. but otherwise it''s good.', '2007-12-21 20:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329159, 622493, 88010, '<td valign="top">Close is nice, not quite in focus and no dof and a bit too hot.</td>', 'Close is nice, not quite in focus and no dof and a bit too hot.', '2007-12-21 20:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329161, 623211, 88010, '<td valign="top">I like it. The red jumps right out. The snow is caught nicely in mid air. The pose is pleasant. Nice job.</td>', 'I like it. The red jumps right out. The snow is caught nicely in mid air. The pose is pleasant. Nice job.', '2007-12-21 20:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329162, 622739, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections, though I do find the centered horizon does not work for me in this. Not sure it fits "Wabi-Sabi", but it does fit "everyday"</td>', 'Nice reflections, though I do find the centered horizon does not work for me in this. Not sure it fits "Wabi-Sabi", but it does fit "everyday"', '2007-12-21 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329163, 623645, 88010, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this is poorly done. too dark, not focused, it says nothing. sorry.</td>', 'Sorry but this is poorly done. too dark, not focused, it says nothing. sorry.', '2007-12-21 20:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329166, 623016, 88010, '<td valign="top">Hey thats pretty cool.</td>', 'Hey thats pretty cool.', '2007-12-21 20:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329168, 623771, 88010, '<td valign="top">Hey, a pencil sharpener. I''ld recognize that anywhere :) Nicely done.</td>', 'Hey, a pencil sharpener. I''ld recognize that anywhere :) Nicely done.', '2007-12-21 20:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329169, 622358, 88010, '<td valign="top">I wish that dead white sky wasn''t in the top right corner. If that had been filled with colorful tree''s I sure would have rated this higher. Nice exposure, colors, saturation.</td>', 'I wish that dead white sky wasn''t in the top right corner. If that had been filled with colorful tree''s I sure would have rated this higher. Nice exposure, colors, saturation.', '2007-12-21 20:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329173, 622705, 88010, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool shot. I might try this myself. I do think a half stop more light on this side of the hands would raise the points considerably.</td>', 'That''s a cool shot. I might try this myself. I do think a half stop more light on this side of the hands would raise the points considerably.', '2007-12-21 20:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329175, 623819, 88010, '<td valign="top">nice dreamy look to this shot.</td>', 'nice dreamy look to this shot.', '2007-12-21 20:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329176, 622407, 88010, '<td valign="top">Hey I feel warmer already. Nice shot.</td>', 'Hey I feel warmer already. Nice shot.', '2007-12-21 20:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329177, 622433, 88010, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. I love "trying" to shoot birds.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. I love "trying" to shoot birds.', '2007-12-21 20:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
