(4329234, 623338, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject, definitely in the spirit of the challenge. But bottom of photo seems a bit washed out compared to top of photo.</td>', 'Lovely subject, definitely in the spirit of the challenge. But bottom of photo seems a bit washed out compared to top of photo.', '2007-12-21 21:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329244, 623513, 62249, '<td valign="top">Crop a little tighter, removing some off both top &amp; bottom, to fill more of the frame with the shell &amp; the rippled sand. That part of the photo is lovely.</td>', 'Crop a little tighter, removing some off both top & bottom, to fill more of the frame with the shell & the rippled sand. That part of the photo is lovely.', '2007-12-21 22:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329256, 623032, 62249, '<td valign="top">Needs better lighting.</td>', 'Needs better lighting.', '2007-12-21 22:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329257, 623728, 62249, '<td valign="top">Poorly lit and not very creative.</td>', 'Poorly lit and not very creative.', '2007-12-21 22:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329294, 623544, 76217, '<td valign="top">Seems more like a still life. Almost "too good" to meet the challenge, It seems posed. It looks as though every leaf and rock were placed exactly where they needed to be to enhance the composition of the photo. But it''s not "too good enough" to not give a 10 to, and way too cool to not add to my favorites.</td>', 'Seems more like a still life. Almost "too good" to meet the challenge, It seems posed. It looks as though every leaf and rock were placed exactly where they needed to be to enhance the composition of the photo. But it''s not "too good enough" to not give a 10 to, and way too cool to not add to my favorites.', '2007-12-21 23:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329307, 622171, 51750, '<td valign="top">dada?</td>', 'dada?', '2007-12-21 23:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329313, 623551, 76217, '<td valign="top">Fits theme perfectly. I appreciate that you left the light pole and power lines in. I would have been tempted to crop them out and I would have been left with a crappy photo. 8</td>', 'Fits theme perfectly. I appreciate that you left the light pole and power lines in. I would have been tempted to crop them out and I would have been left with a crappy photo. 8', '2007-12-21 23:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
