(4329761, 622323, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a good scene that fits "everyday", but I don''t see it fitting the "Wabi-Sabi" idea. It is quite nice, however. I like the expressions and the angle. Too bad about that light pole off in the corner, but you can clone that out when you are not concerned about challenge rules.</td>', 'It''s a good scene that fits "everyday", but I don''t see it fitting the "Wabi-Sabi" idea. It is quite nice, however. I like the expressions and the angle. Too bad about that light pole off in the corner, but you can clone that out when you are not concerned about challenge rules.', '2007-12-22 11:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329764, 622781, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure whether it fits the Wabi-Sabi idea or not, but I like it. It''s certainly "everyday".</td>', 'Not sure whether it fits the Wabi-Sabi idea or not, but I like it. It''s certainly "everyday".', '2007-12-22 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329767, 622782, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cigarette burning is certainly everyday, though this sort of view of it is not. Curling smoke is an imperfect thing, so it may fit "Wabi-Sabi", depending upon your definition. Regardless, it''s nicely done.</td>', 'A cigarette burning is certainly everyday, though this sort of view of it is not. Curling smoke is an imperfect thing, so it may fit "Wabi-Sabi", depending upon your definition. Regardless, it''s nicely done.', '2007-12-22 11:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329774, 623327, 83313, '<td valign="top">Those are indeed odd looking. Do you have any idea of what they represent or are for?<br/> <br/>I find the square crop is a little distracting, it pulls my eye up toward the upper left portion. If I scroll it on my screen to cut off the top 1/3, then the image flows nicely and my eye is perfectly drawn to the one above the doorway.</td>', 'Those are indeed odd looking. Do you have any idea of what they represent or are for? I find the square crop is a little distracting, it pulls my eye up toward the upper left portion. If I scroll it on my screen to cut off the top 1/3, then the image flows nicely and my eye is perfectly drawn to the one above the doorway.', '2007-12-22 11:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329777, 621954, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Fits both "everyday" and "Wabi-Sabi". Plus, it is just a fascinating portrait of this street musician. A 9 and a fave for this.</td>', 'This is a great shot. Fits both "everyday" and "Wabi-Sabi". Plus, it is just a fascinating portrait of this street musician. A 9 and a fave for this.', '2007-12-22 11:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329780, 623334, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a good scene that fits "everyday", though I don''t see it fitting the "Wabi-Sabi" idea. I do like it, however. Maybe a little more sharpness or contrast on the details of the arch would be good, but that''s about all I can criticize for this one.</td>', 'It''s a good scene that fits "everyday", though I don''t see it fitting the "Wabi-Sabi" idea. I do like it, however. Maybe a little more sharpness or contrast on the details of the arch would be good, but that''s about all I can criticize for this one.', '2007-12-22 11:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329781, 622739, 71608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection!</td>', 'Beautiful reflection!', '2007-12-22 11:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329783, 623340, 71608, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field!</td>', 'Great depth of field!', '2007-12-22 11:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329787, 623236, 83313, '<td valign="top">A decent landscape, though I find it lacks the impact it could have. I think the mountains are too far away and their majesty competes with the city in the foreground. Tweaking curves and saturation a bit would also help the sunrise colors in the sky to stand out better.<br/> <br/>From the styling of the roofs, I assume you are somewhere in the far east.</td>', 'A decent landscape, though I find it lacks the impact it could have. I think the mountains are too far away and their majesty competes with the city in the foreground. Tweaking curves and saturation a bit would also help the sunrise colors in the sky to stand out better. From the styling of the roofs, I assume you are somewhere in the far east.', '2007-12-22 12:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329789, 623516, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. Fits both "everyday" and "Wabi-Sabi". I really like all the texture that is showing here.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. Fits both "everyday" and "Wabi-Sabi". I really like all the texture that is showing here.', '2007-12-22 12:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329791, 623860, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Perhaps zooming in on the leaf a little more may have been good. I find my attention divided a bit between the leaf and the large timber on the left.</td>', 'Nicely done. Perhaps zooming in on the leaf a little more may have been good. I find my attention divided a bit between the leaf and the large timber on the left.', '2007-12-22 12:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329795, 623375, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cute image of this guy. He looks sweet. The DOF isn''t the greatest, and the out of focus nose is distracting form the rest of an otherwise good shot.</td>', 'A cute image of this guy. He looks sweet. The DOF isn''t the greatest, and the out of focus nose is distracting form the rest of an otherwise good shot.', '2007-12-22 12:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329800, 621900, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that a staged scene like this fits "everyday", though the stones can certainly be considered Wabi-Sabi. A very creative idea to let the glow of the sun filter through the rocks. Nicely done regardless of if it fits the definitions or not.</td>', 'I''m not sure that a staged scene like this fits "everyday", though the stones can certainly be considered Wabi-Sabi. A very creative idea to let the glow of the sun filter through the rocks. Nicely done regardless of if it fits the definitions or not.', '2007-12-22 12:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329805, 622797, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though a touch too centered for me. I would have also liked to see more of the details in the house than the amount of field showing. Love the colors and lighting. I see you make good use of that awesome late afternoon/early evening sun. It''s the "magic hour" in my book.</td>', 'Nice, though a touch too centered for me. I would have also liked to see more of the details in the house than the amount of field showing. Love the colors and lighting. I see you make good use of that awesome late afternoon/early evening sun. It''s the "magic hour" in my book.', '2007-12-22 12:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329813, 622938, 83313, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m not up to speed on my literature. What''s the fable portrayed here? Nice use of the colors, but my eye is divided between the bird and the leaf, rather than being led from one to the other. With nature photography, you kind of take what you get to a large extent. Animals don''t exactly pose for you!</td>', 'I guess I''m not up to speed on my literature. What''s the fable portrayed here? Nice use of the colors, but my eye is divided between the bird and the leaf, rather than being led from one to the other. With nature photography, you kind of take what you get to a large extent. Animals don''t exactly pose for you!', '2007-12-22 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329819, 623559, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I''m not sure what to make of this. the details of the main subject seem to not be quite clear, though that may be intentional.</td>', 'Interesting. I''m not sure what to make of this. the details of the main subject seem to not be quite clear, though that may be intentional.', '2007-12-22 12:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4329820, 623665, 88004, '<td valign="top">I think that this picture would be stronger if the bottom area were cropped leaving just the bump. Very simple and effective. Great job and good luck on the contest. :D</td>', 'I think that this picture would be stronger if the bottom area were cropped leaving just the bump. Very simple and effective. Great job and good luck on the contest. :D', '2007-12-22 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
