(4330363, 623251, 81213, '<td valign="top">I would give this a five, but I dislike the title oh so much... 4</td>', 'I would give this a five, but I dislike the title oh so much... 4', '2007-12-22 18:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330364, 622739, 81213, '<td valign="top">it doesn''t really look like a sunset, more like the sun is behind a pole at the moment. I love the refelction in the pole. 4</td>', 'it doesn''t really look like a sunset, more like the sun is behind a pole at the moment. I love the refelction in the pole. 4', '2007-12-22 18:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330366, 623744, 81213, '<td valign="top">Nice 3D lines and dimentions. Red door sticks out a lot. Snow, trees... Those are the good things...<br/> <br/>Here are the bad things: Can''t see, over exposed, bad lighting, no real sky. Not much contrast...</td>', 'Nice 3D lines and dimentions. Red door sticks out a lot. Snow, trees... Those are the good things... Here are the bad things: Can''t see, over exposed, bad lighting, no real sky. Not much contrast...', '2007-12-22 18:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330367, 623621, 81213, '<td valign="top">Very low contrast... 2</td>', 'Very low contrast... 2', '2007-12-22 18:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330368, 622719, 81213, '<td valign="top">Low the expression, but it appears you used the flash and the carpet is showing underneith... Needs to be a little darker and if this was a fill frame shot, I might of even given it a 7 or an 8...<br/> <br/>Despite the unfortionet "Yin/Yang Cat" title, I gave this a 4</td>', 'Low the expression, but it appears you used the flash and the carpet is showing underneith... Needs to be a little darker and if this was a fill frame shot, I might of even given it a 7 or an 8... Despite the unfortionet "Yin/Yang Cat" title, I gave this a 4', '2007-12-22 18:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330369, 623844, 81213, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2007-12-22 18:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330376, 623860, 1024, '<td valign="top">I think this would be much more powerful if it filled the frame a little more (ie. getting rid of some of the distracting background elements).  The leaf itself is wonderful for this challenge.</td>', 'I think this would be much more powerful if it filled the frame a little more (ie. getting rid of some of the distracting background elements).  The leaf itself is wonderful for this challenge.', '2007-12-22 19:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330378, 623828, 1024, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like bronze.  Lovely symmetry and rich details.</td>', 'It almost looks like bronze.  Lovely symmetry and rich details.', '2007-12-22 19:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330381, 622790, 1024, '<td valign="top">Deeply moving photograph and perfect lighting.</td>', 'Deeply moving photograph and perfect lighting.', '2007-12-22 19:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330490, 622918, 26364, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the chair in the right third. It would look more inviting to have more space in front of the chair.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the chair in the right third. It would look more inviting to have more space in front of the chair.', '2007-12-22 21:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330603, 623016, 19245, '<td valign="top">nice composition!!</td>', 'nice composition!!', '2007-12-22 23:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330616, 623862, 55117, '<td valign="top">Not bad. Not great. Worth a 5.</td>', 'Not bad. Not great. Worth a 5.', '2007-12-22 23:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330617, 623851, 55117, '<td valign="top">Like the coloring and slight desaturation.</td>', 'Like the coloring and slight desaturation.', '2007-12-22 23:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4330618, 623757, 55117, '<td valign="top">Snapshot.</td>', 'Snapshot.', '2007-12-22 23:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
