(4332903, 623251, 71526, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I really like the composition and your natural backdrop.</td>', 'Great capture. I really like the composition and your natural backdrop.', '2007-12-24 11:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332909, 622426, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is neat looking. I like the pattern of the birds conforming to the shape of the roofline. This has the appearance of something that was just a lucky snapshot that you caught, but it really works for me. The birds have little to do with the gable, except that they are there, but it comes off like a collage.</td>', 'This is neat looking. I like the pattern of the birds conforming to the shape of the roofline. This has the appearance of something that was just a lucky snapshot that you caught, but it really works for me. The birds have little to do with the gable, except that they are there, but it comes off like a collage.', '2007-12-24 11:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332919, 623040, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot that can be considered everyday, but I don''t see it fitting the Wabi-Sabi idea. It is good, however. A little stronger color on the water may have given it some more impact.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot that can be considered everyday, but I don''t see it fitting the Wabi-Sabi idea. It is good, however. A little stronger color on the water may have given it some more impact.', '2007-12-24 11:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332921, 623375, 83416, '<td valign="top">Nice capture  but I would have preferred even more focus on the eyes.</td>', 'Nice capture  but I would have preferred even more focus on the eyes.', '2007-12-24 11:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332931, 623496, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene at an airport perhaps? I like the image, though I don''t know  if a piano at an airport is an everday scene. I don''t see any Wabi-Sabi here at all. Maybe it''s not an airport, that could be a golf course out there, in which case a piano would be something to be found at a country club.</td>', 'Looks like a scene at an airport perhaps? I like the image, though I don''t know  if a piano at an airport is an everday scene. I don''t see any Wabi-Sabi here at all. Maybe it''s not an airport, that could be a golf course out there, in which case a piano would be something to be found at a country club.', '2007-12-24 11:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332935, 623749, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the leaves, and I like the punchy colors. The DOF is lacking a little, but I struggle with the same issue on macros.</td>', 'Nice detail on the leaves, and I like the punchy colors. The DOF is lacking a little, but I struggle with the same issue on macros.', '2007-12-24 11:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332939, 622567, 83416, '<td valign="top">An interesting winter capture: but image to have blue cast and may require color correction.</td>', 'An interesting winter capture: but image to have blue cast and may require color correction.', '2007-12-24 11:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332941, 622493, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, though I find the shallow DOF kills some of the detail that might otherwise be visible in this kitty''s fur.</td>', 'Nice lighting, though I find the shallow DOF kills some of the detail that might otherwise be visible in this kitty''s fur.', '2007-12-24 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332943, 621855, 83416, '<td valign="top">Is the orientation intentional?</td>', 'Is the orientation intentional?', '2007-12-24 11:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332944, 622626, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple, but it works. Great colors. My only quibbles are the shadow at the top left and the minor loss of DOF at the left side of the chair. This shows a good eye. An interesting shot of an everyday item. Fits both "everyday" and "Wabi-Sabi".</td>', 'Simple, but it works. Great colors. My only quibbles are the shadow at the top left and the minor loss of DOF at the left side of the chair. This shows a good eye. An interesting shot of an everyday item. Fits both "everyday" and "Wabi-Sabi".', '2007-12-24 11:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332945, 623236, 83416, '<td valign="top">The roofs in the foreground are a bit distracting  Id crop them out.</td>', 'The roofs in the foreground are a bit distracting  Id crop them out.', '2007-12-24 11:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332947, 623812, 83313, '<td valign="top">A victim of the white Christmas you folks up north are getting? I like the orange color and all the shriveled details. Good comp.</td>', 'A victim of the white Christmas you folks up north are getting? I like the orange color and all the shriveled details. Good comp.', '2007-12-24 11:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332948, 623256, 83416, '<td valign="top">I think the foreground is too dark  assuming this was not intended as silhouette image.</td>', 'I think the foreground is too dark  assuming this was not intended as silhouette image.', '2007-12-24 11:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332957, 623044, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Would have worked better for me with out the ribbons, but clearly this area is marked for a reason. Fog and mist almost always give a great effect. I''d live to see this scene with some morning or sundown light.</td>', 'Interesting. Would have worked better for me with out the ribbons, but clearly this area is marked for a reason. Fog and mist almost always give a great effect. I''d live to see this scene with some morning or sundown light.', '2007-12-24 12:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332958, 623144, 83416, '<td valign="top">This is cute!</td>', 'This is cute!', '2007-12-24 12:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332962, 623433, 83416, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea  but unfortunately resulted in blown highlights.</td>', 'Interesting idea  but unfortunately resulted in blown highlights.', '2007-12-24 12:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332964, 623606, 83313, '<td valign="top">I had to go look up the meaning of your title. Very appropriate. An very good image. I like the use of the DOF here. I''m not sure whether I like the bud on the right, or if it is a distraction from the main subject.</td>', 'I had to go look up the meaning of your title. Very appropriate. An very good image. I like the use of the DOF here. I''m not sure whether I like the bud on the right, or if it is a distraction from the main subject.', '2007-12-24 12:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332968, 623880, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this. A touch more lighting on the details up top may have been good, but that''s a minor quibble.</td>', 'I like this. A touch more lighting on the details up top may have been good, but that''s a minor quibble.', '2007-12-24 12:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332973, 622719, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is cute. I like the fang and slightly wonky look. I''m curious if you simply caught the cat with this look on his face, or if this poor kitty has some issues. Great details. This kitty looks like he wants to be scratched behind the ears a bit.</td>', 'This is cute. I like the fang and slightly wonky look. I''m curious if you simply caught the cat with this look on his face, or if this poor kitty has some issues. Great details. This kitty looks like he wants to be scratched behind the ears a bit.', '2007-12-24 12:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332977, 623618, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot with wonderful details showing. I like use of the angle to  give it some oomph. Fits both "everyday" and "Wabi-Sabi".</td>', 'This is a great shot with wonderful details showing. I like use of the angle to  give it some oomph. Fits both "everyday" and "Wabi-Sabi".', '2007-12-24 12:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332982, 622566, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice portrait that can be certainly considered everyday, but it may not quite fit the Wabi-Sabi idea depending on one''s definition.</td>', 'It''s a nice portrait that can be certainly considered everyday, but it may not quite fit the Wabi-Sabi idea depending on one''s definition.', '2007-12-24 12:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332991, 623878, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s everyday,  and a nicely composed urban abstract. I don''t see beautiful imperfections that would make it fit the description of Wabi-Sabi. In fact, it''s pretty much in perfect condition.<br/> <br/>I also see some JPEG compression artifacts showing in the sky surrounding the rods. The image file size at 76k is about half of what you could have used, and with less compression, those artifacts would likely not be visible.</td>', 'It''s everyday,  and a nicely composed urban abstract. I don''t see beautiful imperfections that would make it fit the description of Wabi-Sabi. In fact, it''s pretty much in perfect condition. I also see some JPEG compression artifacts showing in the sky surrounding the rods. The image file size at 76k is about half of what you could have used, and with less compression, those artifacts would likely not be visible.', '2007-12-24 12:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4332997, 622776, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe not an everday view, but there are lots of Wabi-Sabi elements here. Nice effect to flip the picture. Made me give it several looks.</td>', 'Maybe not an everday view, but there are lots of Wabi-Sabi elements here. Nice effect to flip the picture. Made me give it several looks.', '2007-12-24 12:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333002, 622610, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice perspective that fits "everyday", though I don''t see it fitting the "Wabi-Sabi" idea. Almost seems a little scary to me, like some horror movie posters suggesting something is on the other side of the door wanting to get in. punching up the contrast and shadows a bit may have given it some more oomph.</td>', 'It''s a nice perspective that fits "everyday", though I don''t see it fitting the "Wabi-Sabi" idea. Almost seems a little scary to me, like some horror movie posters suggesting something is on the other side of the door wanting to get in. punching up the contrast and shadows a bit may have given it some more oomph.', '2007-12-24 12:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333009, 623651, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good capture done with dim lighting. I find it lacks some detail and clarity, though to be fair, I do not think I could have done better with this.</td>', 'A good capture done with dim lighting. I find it lacks some detail and clarity, though to be fair, I do not think I could have done better with this.', '2007-12-24 12:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333014, 623616, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cat''s always look so satisfied and cozy. A decent shot of this kitty, though I don''t find it outstanding. The blown out highlights on the left and the blinds in the background are the main issues with it. Especially the blinds, because my eye is drawn to those instead of the cats face.</td>', 'Cat''s always look so satisfied and cozy. A decent shot of this kitty, though I don''t find it outstanding. The blown out highlights on the left and the blinds in the background are the main issues with it. Especially the blinds, because my eye is drawn to those instead of the cats face.', '2007-12-24 12:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333017, 623716, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is so everyday and unexpected in this challenge, that it has a lot of impact for me. I''m not sure a lot of other voters will agree, but I''m giving it a good score.<br/> <br/>I prefer crusty rolls, myself.</td>', 'This is so everyday and unexpected in this challenge, that it has a lot of impact for me. I''m not sure a lot of other voters will agree, but I''m giving it a good score. I prefer crusty rolls, myself.', '2007-12-24 12:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333018, 622602, 83313, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be just a smidgen off from the water drop, otherwise this is pretty good. Simple and to the point.</td>', 'The focus seems to be just a smidgen off from the water drop, otherwise this is pretty good. Simple and to the point.', '2007-12-24 12:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333021, 623563, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful scene that could be considered everyday if you live nearby, but I just don''t see it fitting the Wabi-Sabi idea. It is nice, but somehow I am not finding it wows me much.<br/> <br/>There may be a very slight skew, but that could also be my wonky perception of it.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful scene that could be considered everyday if you live nearby, but I just don''t see it fitting the Wabi-Sabi idea. It is nice, but somehow I am not finding it wows me much. There may be a very slight skew, but that could also be my wonky perception of it.', '2007-12-24 12:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333023, 623032, 83313, '<td valign="top">This could be really good if not for the low contrast. That really hurts it.</td>', 'This could be really good if not for the low contrast. That really hurts it.', '2007-12-24 12:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333024, 623641, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very good. Lots of detail and clarity in this.</td>', 'Very good. Lots of detail and clarity in this.', '2007-12-24 12:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333028, 622827, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too centered, but otherwise I like this. Lots of great detail and color. Everyday, but may or may not be considered Wabi-Sabi depending on one''s definition.</td>', 'Maybe a little too centered, but otherwise I like this. Lots of great detail and color. Everyday, but may or may not be considered Wabi-Sabi depending on one''s definition.', '2007-12-24 12:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333030, 623211, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice capture. Love 3D look of the falling snow, and the lighting and colors work well.</td>', 'A nice capture. Love 3D look of the falling snow, and the lighting and colors work well.', '2007-12-24 12:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333035, 623575, 83313, '<td valign="top">If the seagull is really the subject, it''s too small and I almost overlooked it. I do like the texture and details on the beach.</td>', 'If the seagull is really the subject, it''s too small and I almost overlooked it. I do like the texture and details on the beach.', '2007-12-24 12:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333038, 623819, 83416, '<td valign="top">Perfectly conveys the everyday beauty of daytime change.</td>', 'Perfectly conveys the everyday beauty of daytime change.', '2007-12-24 12:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333042, 622705, 83416, '<td valign="top">Indeed  looks like stardust!!! Honestly Great!!!</td>', 'Indeed  looks like stardust!!! Honestly Great!!!', '2007-12-24 12:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333047, 623516, 83416, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the textures! 9</td>', 'Great detail in the textures! 9', '2007-12-24 12:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333060, 622873, 83416, '<td valign="top">The snow appears blown to me and detail is not visible.</td>', 'The snow appears blown to me and detail is not visible.', '2007-12-24 12:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333062, 623449, 83416, '<td valign="top">???</td>', '???', '2007-12-24 12:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333063, 623532, 83416, '<td valign="top">The subject of the picture is a bit dark in my opinion.</td>', 'The subject of the picture is a bit dark in my opinion.', '2007-12-24 13:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333065, 622149, 78483, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and simplicity of this</td>', 'I like the lighting and simplicity of this', '2007-12-24 13:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333071, 622358, 83416, '<td valign="top">Personally  I would have preferred greater DOF in this picture.</td>', 'Personally  I would have preferred greater DOF in this picture.', '2007-12-24 13:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333076, 623748, 83416, '<td valign="top">To me  the pot/plant are distracting.</td>', 'To me  the pot/plant are distracting.', '2007-12-24 13:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333078, 622171, 83416, '<td valign="top">???</td>', '???', '2007-12-24 13:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333080, 623728, 83416, '<td valign="top">Sorry - cannot vote on this one...</td>', 'Sorry - cannot vote on this one...', '2007-12-24 13:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333132, 623650, 78652, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.  Love the depth of field at this range, nice!</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.  Love the depth of field at this range, nice!', '2007-12-24 13:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333139, 622611, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is really cool looking. It absolutely shows the beauty in everyday things. It might not be considered Wabi-Sabi depending on one''s definition.</td>', 'This is really cool looking. It absolutely shows the beauty in everyday things. It might not be considered Wabi-Sabi depending on one''s definition.', '2007-12-24 13:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333143, 622951, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like their expressions, but this really just looks like a quick snapshot. Lots of flash washing out her face, and the object between them is distracting. I''m not finding anything that fits the Wabi-Sabi concept.</td>', 'I like their expressions, but this really just looks like a quick snapshot. Lots of flash washing out her face, and the object between them is distracting. I''m not finding anything that fits the Wabi-Sabi concept.', '2007-12-24 13:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333149, 623234, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective. I''m divided on this one. There is a fair amount of visible skew, but if you corrected the floor skew, then the lamp would be tilted.</td>', 'An interesting perspective. I''m divided on this one. There is a fair amount of visible skew, but if you corrected the floor skew, then the lamp would be tilted.', '2007-12-24 13:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333151, 623451, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice view, though I am not sure I like the reddish tone on this one.</td>', 'Nice view, though I am not sure I like the reddish tone on this one.', '2007-12-24 14:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333160, 623272, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice texture, though there is lots of digital noise visible in it.</td>', 'A nice texture, though there is lots of digital noise visible in it.', '2007-12-24 14:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333166, 623324, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and detail in the stones, but the silver surface they are on does not seem to fit, as well as the fact that it is badly skewed in this image.</td>', 'I love the colors and detail in the stones, but the silver surface they are on does not seem to fit, as well as the fact that it is badly skewed in this image.', '2007-12-24 14:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333170, 623726, 78652, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I especially like how much depth of field there is for a shot in this range, good detail.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I especially like how much depth of field there is for a shot in this range, good detail.', '2007-12-24 14:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333174, 623828, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a very interesting old door, with lots of detail, but the lighting is not helping. It''s rather flat. I think perhaps a closer view, maybe a perspective detail shot, would have done justice to it.</td>', 'It''s a very interesting old door, with lots of detail, but the lighting is not helping. It''s rather flat. I think perhaps a closer view, maybe a perspective detail shot, would have done justice to it.', '2007-12-24 14:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333176, 623771, 78652, '<td valign="top">Haven''t seen one of these in a long time.</td>', 'Haven''t seen one of these in a long time.', '2007-12-24 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333181, 623192, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like this, though I am finding my eye tends to flow up toward the out of focus pier.</td>', 'I really like this, though I am finding my eye tends to flow up toward the out of focus pier.', '2007-12-24 14:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333184, 623357, 78652, '<td valign="top">I like these kinds of shots where you''re invited to examine all the details.  Perhaps stopping down on the aperture could provide more detail to admire.  Nice shot, and nice lighting.</td>', 'I like these kinds of shots where you''re invited to examine all the details.  Perhaps stopping down on the aperture could provide more detail to admire.  Nice shot, and nice lighting.', '2007-12-24 14:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333187, 622931, 78652, '<td valign="top">I love this location!  Maybe waiting later in the day could''ve provided more saturation in the colors.  Nice setting!</td>', 'I love this location!  Maybe waiting later in the day could''ve provided more saturation in the colors.  Nice setting!', '2007-12-24 14:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333194, 623787, 78652, '<td valign="top">I like the warm colors.  Maybe stopping down could''ve brought more of the foreground log''s rings into focus.</td>', 'I like the warm colors.  Maybe stopping down could''ve brought more of the foreground log''s rings into focus.', '2007-12-24 14:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333204, 623021, 78652, '<td valign="top">love the blue orange contrast.  did you take a shot framing higher?  just wondering if taking a shot with less of the ground would''ve given the illusion of a much taller farther reaching crane.</td>', 'love the blue orange contrast.  did you take a shot framing higher?  just wondering if taking a shot with less of the ground would''ve given the illusion of a much taller farther reaching crane.', '2007-12-24 14:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333205, 622228, 78652, '<td valign="top">what caught my eye in this photo is just left and above the shining spotlight, it looks like a giant "nun" with glasses staring down.</td>', 'what caught my eye in this photo is just left and above the shining spotlight, it looks like a giant "nun" with glasses staring down.', '2007-12-24 14:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333209, 623513, 78652, '<td valign="top">Would''ve loved to see a close up of the star.</td>', 'Would''ve loved to see a close up of the star.', '2007-12-24 14:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333220, 623828, 78652, '<td valign="top">I would''ve loved to see a close up of the detailing on the door.  Nice find.</td>', 'I would''ve loved to see a close up of the detailing on the door.  Nice find.', '2007-12-24 14:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333233, 622239, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, because of the graininess. From the lace a the bottom, I think it is a woman''s lower back tattoo. I''m not caring for it. If the heavy grain was an artistic effort, I''m afraid it''s not working for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, because of the graininess. From the lace a the bottom, I think it is a woman''s lower back tattoo. I''m not caring for it. If the heavy grain was an artistic effort, I''m afraid it''s not working for me.', '2007-12-24 14:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333235, 623461, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice catch of something that was clearly moving fast, but as an entry, it lacking some. Blurry, grainy and other than a neat catch of the bird in flight, not much interest. Sorry to be so harsh on it.</td>', 'It''s a nice catch of something that was clearly moving fast, but as an entry, it lacking some. Blurry, grainy and other than a neat catch of the bird in flight, not much interest. Sorry to be so harsh on it.', '2007-12-24 14:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333237, 623848, 83313, '<td valign="top">I feel that this is a shoehorned entry. It''s a cute portrait, but a portrait dressed up for Christmas is not everyday, and I don''t see anything Wabi-Sabi about this, except for perhaps the scratch on her chin.</td>', 'I feel that this is a shoehorned entry. It''s a cute portrait, but a portrait dressed up for Christmas is not everyday, and I don''t see anything Wabi-Sabi about this, except for perhaps the scratch on her chin.', '2007-12-24 14:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333240, 623099, 83313, '<td valign="top">This little girl looks sad. Piercing eyes. Other than the pole coming out of her head, this is a decent shot.</td>', 'This little girl looks sad. Piercing eyes. Other than the pole coming out of her head, this is a decent shot.', '2007-12-24 14:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333265, 623335, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a hanging lamp of some kind. Makes a nice abstract.</td>', 'Looks like a hanging lamp of some kind. Makes a nice abstract.', '2007-12-24 15:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333275, 623599, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think it''s perhaps a little too ordinary. I''m not seeing anything particularly of interest in this image. There is a lot of color cast and high ISO noise. I do see some effort at composition though. My eye is led from the  lower right corner, across the rail, up the wall and over to the other railing.</td>', 'I think it''s perhaps a little too ordinary. I''m not seeing anything particularly of interest in this image. There is a lot of color cast and high ISO noise. I do see some effort at composition though. My eye is led from the  lower right corner, across the rail, up the wall and over to the other railing.', '2007-12-24 15:16:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4333276, 623668, 83313, '<td valign="top">...but not an everyday shot of it. A very good macro, though I am not really sure it is a good fit for the challenge theme.</td>', '...but not an everyday shot of it. A very good macro, though I am not really sure it is a good fit for the challenge theme.', '2007-12-24 15:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333281, 623869, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good street scene with strong colors and lots of interest. Maybe a little too much going on. Perhaps a little Wabi-Sabi behind the red wall, though it is not really the main subject.</td>', 'A good street scene with strong colors and lots of interest. Maybe a little too much going on. Perhaps a little Wabi-Sabi behind the red wall, though it is not really the main subject.', '2007-12-24 15:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333282, 623144, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is cute. Wish the DOF was better on the cup.</td>', 'This is cute. Wish the DOF was better on the cup.', '2007-12-24 15:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333287, 622057, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though the white background seems to not contrast enough with the pottery. It just does not stand out enough. I wonder if a colored background would work better here? Perhaps composing it by staggering the two pieces of pottery might have also been less static.</td>', 'Nice, though the white background seems to not contrast enough with the pottery. It just does not stand out enough. I wonder if a colored background would work better here? Perhaps composing it by staggering the two pieces of pottery might have also been less static.', '2007-12-24 15:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333289, 622200, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very everyday and somewhat Wabi-Sabi. I like the tones, but the overall image does not wow me.</td>', 'Very everyday and somewhat Wabi-Sabi. I like the tones, but the overall image does not wow me.', '2007-12-24 15:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333290, 623870, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the way you handled the colors of the cobblestones, and the composition works for me.</td>', 'I like the way you handled the colors of the cobblestones, and the composition works for me.', '2007-12-24 15:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4333293, 622910, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wish it had a little more DOF, but this is a very cool looking instrument. Lots of character in it. A solid 7.</td>', 'Wish it had a little more DOF, but this is a very cool looking instrument. Lots of character in it. A solid 7.', '2007-12-24 15:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
