(4334397, 623862, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of light and shapes. The perspective distortion is interesting, it is hard for me to tell whether it is adding to the image or substracting from it. I assume you tried correcting it and ended up liking it better this way. Anyway, you can''t help but look directly in the direction of the tilted columns, so, the inclination is probably distracting. The light and white balance is perfect though, look at that white snow !!</td>', 'Beautiful capture of light and shapes. The perspective distortion is interesting, it is hard for me to tell whether it is adding to the image or substracting from it. I assume you tried correcting it and ended up liking it better this way. Anyway, you can''t help but look directly in the direction of the tilted columns, so, the inclination is probably distracting. The light and white balance is perfect though, look at that white snow !!', '2007-12-25 13:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
