(4335071, 622426, 66384, '<td valign="top">The shadows remind me, in a good way, of the veins in a heart. The house is glowing with life. It looks as if the gable is translucent and the light is coming from within. I really love the contrast in this image and the warm colors. And I don''t mind what appears to be over-sharpening, because this image is so simple in its composition that the white outlines  give it a clean crispness.</td>', 'The shadows remind me, in a good way, of the veins in a heart. The house is glowing with life. It looks as if the gable is translucent and the light is coming from within. I really love the contrast in this image and the warm colors. And I don''t mind what appears to be over-sharpening, because this image is so simple in its composition that the white outlines  give it a clean crispness.', '2007-12-26 00:44:04.000000', NULL, 0),
