(4335236, 622426, 30982, '<td valign="top">I pretty much thought this totally rocked, though I doubt anyone actually says that any more.  Excellent example of how the everyday has significant moments of wonder.</td>', 'I pretty much thought this totally rocked, though I doubt anyone actually says that any more.  Excellent example of how the everyday has significant moments of wonder.', '2007-12-26 03:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4335238, 622626, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how the chair is becoming part of its environment - blends right in and feels right at home there.  It may be outcast from other, newer chairs, but it belongs with the rest of the scene quite well.</td>', 'I like how the chair is becoming part of its environment - blends right in and feels right at home there.  It may be outcast from other, newer chairs, but it belongs with the rest of the scene quite well.', '2007-12-26 03:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4335239, 623061, 30982, '<td valign="top">I had a hard time with scenery shots in this challenge - I tend to think pretty landscapes are always pretty and it''s not hard to find beauty in them.  But that''s just me.  What I do like about this is the shadow of the fence and how it leads you to the corner, moreso than the actual fence.</td>', 'I had a hard time with scenery shots in this challenge - I tend to think pretty landscapes are always pretty and it''s not hard to find beauty in them.  But that''s just me.  What I do like about this is the shadow of the fence and how it leads you to the corner, moreso than the actual fence.', '2007-12-26 03:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
