(4335256, 623272, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ewwww!  Poor grouse!  I found a dead bird in my yard one winter but I think it had simply dropped dead out of the sky - middle of the yard, no windows.  Good idea to shoot (heh!) the poor thing!  Has a nice flow to it, makes a nice abstract.</td>', 'Ewwww!  Poor grouse!  I found a dead bird in my yard one winter but I think it had simply dropped dead out of the sky - middle of the yard, no windows.  Good idea to shoot (heh!) the poor thing!  Has a nice flow to it, makes a nice abstract.', '2007-12-26 03:32:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4335264, 623677, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a treasure of a book to have!  I kinda agree with Richard that I''d have preferred just a bit more of the story to be in focus - to tease us even more with what is written there.  And thank you ever so much for putting the writing into your notes.  I''ve fallen in love with the first line of the second stanza.</td>', 'What a treasure of a book to have!  I kinda agree with Richard that I''d have preferred just a bit more of the story to be in focus - to tease us even more with what is written there.  And thank you ever so much for putting the writing into your notes.  I''ve fallen in love with the first line of the second stanza.', '2007-12-26 03:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
