(4335482, 621855, 71526, '<td valign="top">After the challenge:<br/> <br/>Average: 4.7868... Pretty bad! I was expected a 6+ or so.... Perhaps I''m too optimistic! :)<br/> <br/>A lot here posted about the orientation of this shot. I submitted it this way instead of a 90 degrees CCW because this is the way you see it. You can see the water flowing upwards this way. You can even notice the main part of the fountain behind her. Perhaps this view is so common to me... but a bit weird to most of you.<br/> <br/>I talked about this in the picture in Photographer''s Comments but I did not know voters were unable to see it (this is my 1st submit). Next time i will use a more descriptive title! :)</td>', 'After the challenge: Average: 4.7868... Pretty bad! I was expected a 6+ or so.... Perhaps I''m too optimistic! :) A lot here posted about the orientation of this shot. I submitted it this way instead of a 90 degrees CCW because this is the way you see it. You can see the water flowing upwards this way. You can even notice the main part of the fountain behind her. Perhaps this view is so common to me... but a bit weird to most of you. I talked about this in the picture in Photographer''s Comments but I did not know voters were unable to see it (this is my 1st submit). Next time i will use a more descriptive title! :)', '2007-12-26 06:46:31.000000', NULL, 0),
