(4335862, 623851, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think my fave part of this was the dark toned water color background.  I liked the forcus on the blue berries - it makes them stand out from all the others, even the blurred ones.  I like the composition.  My guess is that many did not see the comparison between the two groups (although, i have to admit, I''m still looking for the mushrooms!)  :)</td>', 'I think my fave part of this was the dark toned water color background.  I liked the forcus on the blue berries - it makes them stand out from all the others, even the blurred ones.  I like the composition.  My guess is that many did not see the comparison between the two groups (although, i have to admit, I''m still looking for the mushrooms!)  :)', '2007-12-26 10:05:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4335871, 623869, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh look, Jayson does work in color lol.  During the challenge this struck me as such a quirky photo - which I liked of course.  Your title made me stop and look.  I think the one thing that stood out for me was that it looks like there''s graffiti on the ostrich pic.  Guess 2009 doesn''t come early enough for some folks. ;)</td>', 'Oh look, Jayson does work in color lol.  During the challenge this struck me as such a quirky photo - which I liked of course.  Your title made me stop and look.  I think the one thing that stood out for me was that it looks like there''s graffiti on the ostrich pic.  Guess 2009 doesn''t come early enough for some folks. ;)', '2007-12-26 10:11:08.000000', NULL, 0),
