(4335905, 623516, 24454, '<td valign="top">You are just amazing the way you can do that.   If I had taken a picture of a shovel. . .it would be in the 4''s. . .but you have taken the every day, like you always do, and it is true photographic art!  And like I''ve told you before. . .even your flaws make your photos look flawless!  CONGRATULATIONS on 12th place.<br/> <br/></td>', 'You are just amazing the way you can do that.   If I had taken a picture of a shovel. . .it would be in the 4''s. . .but you have taken the every day, like you always do, and it is true photographic art!  And like I''ve told you before. . .even your flaws make your photos look flawless!  CONGRATULATIONS on 12th place. ', '2007-12-26 10:31:56.000000', NULL, 0),
