(4336271, 623282, 39110, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 13 7''s. I felt it met the challenge a lot better than alot of images as it was something that was everyday. Apart from the out of focus cannister the technicals on this are good. You got some good feedback and you learnt something new that is great ;)I notice that you are 11. You have done a great job for your age and I can see you will do well here with a bit of perserverance. I presume someone has pointed out to you some of the younger memebrs of DPC if they havent let me know and I will show you</td>', 'I was one of your 13 7''s. I felt it met the challenge a lot better than alot of images as it was something that was everyday. Apart from the out of focus cannister the technicals on this are good. You got some good feedback and you learnt something new that is great ;)I notice that you are 11. You have done a great job for your age and I can see you will do well here with a bit of perserverance. I presume someone has pointed out to you some of the younger memebrs of DPC if they havent let me know and I will show you', '2007-12-26 13:38:53.000000', NULL, 0),
