(4336556, 623750, 28882, '<td valign="top">i think there are elements here to a great shot.  The added text seemed to prevent viewers from taking it seriously if i can assume this by lack of comments.  For me, i like the composition and the subject, i like the fading background due to haze.  Two other negatives stand out here for me, one seems to be from post processing, there are some jagged lines around the clouds and haloing around the structure.  you may need help with resizing and sharpening.   Second is that possibly is that the subject isn''t as "everyday" as many would see it.</td>', 'i think there are elements here to a great shot.  The added text seemed to prevent viewers from taking it seriously if i can assume this by lack of comments.  For me, i like the composition and the subject, i like the fading background due to haze.  Two other negatives stand out here for me, one seems to be from post processing, there are some jagged lines around the clouds and haloing around the structure.  you may need help with resizing and sharpening.   Second is that possibly is that the subject isn''t as "everyday" as many would see it.', '2007-12-26 16:09:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4336722, 623061, 66384, '<td valign="top">Bob, this is a beautiful picture. I love the color, light, and composition. I didn''t think this was what was meant by the challenge subject after I read up on Wabi-Sabi. I would have scored it higher in a Free Study or landscape challenge.</td>', 'Bob, this is a beautiful picture. I love the color, light, and composition. I didn''t think this was what was meant by the challenge subject after I read up on Wabi-Sabi. I would have scored it higher in a Free Study or landscape challenge.', '2007-12-26 17:38:27.000000', NULL, 0),
