(4338053, 622931, 75842, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments! This was my first entry and I guess it was an ok one. There are probably some adjustments I could have done to make it look better, by I''m really no photoshop pro. Should have removed the house on the far left as well. Feel free to become my photoshop mentor! ;-)<br/> <br/>Don''t think I did anything else but saturation and cropping here really, so it''s almost the original picture. It''s somewhere south on Iceland btw.</td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments! This was my first entry and I guess it was an ok one. There are probably some adjustments I could have done to make it look better, by I''m really no photoshop pro. Should have removed the house on the far left as well. Feel free to become my photoshop mentor! ;-) Don''t think I did anything else but saturation and cropping here really, so it''s almost the original picture. It''s somewhere south on Iceland btw.', '2007-12-27 08:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
