(4339847, 623832, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very good choice of subject for the challenge  I think you got some fair comments as to why voters might not have liked it as much as you did, too.  That makes it a very good entry!  You liked it, some didn''t like it and they took the time to tell you why.  To me, the centered thing kinda makes it static (well, duh!  It''s a fencepost!  It ain''t supposed to go anywhere... but you know what I mean.)  Also, it does appear a bit oversharpened but that''s very hard to avoid when resizing to fit the 640 pixel limit - no doubt this is not a problem at a fuller size.</td>', 'A very good choice of subject for the challenge  I think you got some fair comments as to why voters might not have liked it as much as you did, too.  That makes it a very good entry!  You liked it, some didn''t like it and they took the time to tell you why.  To me, the centered thing kinda makes it static (well, duh!  It''s a fencepost!  It ain''t supposed to go anywhere... but you know what I mean.)  Also, it does appear a bit oversharpened but that''s very hard to avoid when resizing to fit the 640 pixel limit - no doubt this is not a problem at a fuller size.', '2007-12-27 22:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
