(4345404, 623461, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the soft focus. I love the background with the fringe of green at the top and the flakes of snow. What I would change, if this was my image, is the white halo around the bird. It can''t be done under the basic editing rules, but I would use the clone tool to erase the halo.</td>', 'I don''t mind the soft focus. I love the background with the fringe of green at the top and the flakes of snow. What I would change, if this was my image, is the white halo around the bird. It can''t be done under the basic editing rules, but I would use the clone tool to erase the halo.', '2007-12-30 16:50:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4345461, 622918, 66494, '<td valign="top">Simplicity is beauty at its best. Loved this one.</td>', 'Simplicity is beauty at its best. Loved this one.', '2007-12-30 17:03:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4345712, 623671, 11793, '<td valign="top">it works and it doesn''t.<br/> <br/>congrats.<br/> <br/></td>', 'it works and it doesn''t. congrats. ', '2007-12-30 18:51:26.000000', NULL, 0),
