(4383317, 623061, 67697, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of those beautiful crisp and clear days.  I love the blue reflections coming from the fence.</td>', 'Looks like one of those beautiful crisp and clear days.  I love the blue reflections coming from the fence.', '2008-01-10 22:41:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4387192, 623625, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m not typically a cat fan but this is a pretty cool shot.  I love the cat caught in motion because I''m sure we all know that animals never hold still for a photo.  Is that a bit of flying grass too?  Pretty cool.</td>', 'I''m not typically a cat fan but this is a pretty cool shot.  I love the cat caught in motion because I''m sure we all know that animals never hold still for a photo.  Is that a bit of flying grass too?  Pretty cool.', '2008-01-12 15:15:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4389156, 623493, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is really sweet, and the side light makes it just excellent.  I have an old "Motors Manual" that has all the specs for this car in it.</td>', 'This is really sweet, and the side light makes it just excellent.  I have an old "Motors Manual" that has all the specs for this car in it.', '2008-01-13 14:24:21.000000', NULL, 0),
