(4422398, 622407, 49804, '<td valign="top">This is a really unique shot, and i like it a lot. I think it should have scored better than it did. The only thing i can think of that would add anything would be to have a faster shutter speed, this would give the fire a bit more detail, maybe causing the voters to vote you higher.</td>', 'This is a really unique shot, and i like it a lot. I think it should have scored better than it did. The only thing i can think of that would add anything would be to have a faster shutter speed, this would give the fire a bit more detail, maybe causing the voters to vote you higher.', '2008-01-24 18:16:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4427074, 623516, 64670, '<td valign="top">This is SO DELICIOUS!  You are the master at seeing beauty in the everyday - I admire that so much!</td>', 'This is SO DELICIOUS!  You are the master at seeing beauty in the everyday - I admire that so much!', '2008-01-26 17:46:59.000000', NULL, 0),
