(4505683, 622938, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s funny.  When this image first came up on screen I immediately thought; this could be a bookcover (honest!) - then I saw the title.  :-)<br/> <br/>This photo is one that engages the viewer.  Asks questions, and makes me think/wonder.  Very cool.<br/> <br/>The bokeh and colors work very well together also.  Nicely done!</td>', 'It''s funny.  When this image first came up on screen I immediately thought; this could be a bookcover (honest!) - then I saw the title.  :-) This photo is one that engages the viewer.  Asks questions, and makes me think/wonder.  Very cool. The bokeh and colors work very well together also.  Nicely done!', '2008-02-21 21:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
