(5145565, 623329, 52130, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by shundaroni:</b></div><hr/><i> Another potentially great shot hindered by poor composition, poor lighting,  and no color saturation. Had the whole bottle been in the shot with some soft lighting on the flower, and a little post-processing to enhance saturation, this would have been killer. Why is it being lit from behind? That just screams "rushed shot". Plan this stuff out if you intend to enter it into competitions. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>...troll. Notice their average score given and how many challebges they have entered.</td>', 'Originally posted by shundaroni: Another potentially great shot hindered by poor composition, poor lighting,  and no color saturation. Had the whole bottle been in the shot with some soft lighting on the flower, and a little post-processing to enhance saturation, this would have been killer. Why is it being lit from behind? That just screams "rushed shot". Plan this stuff out if you intend to enter it into competitions.   ...troll. Notice their average score given and how many challebges they have entered.', '2008-12-22 05:00:48.000000', NULL, 0),
